<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOHN Dungjuiya Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="toc2">John</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHN</para>
  <para style="mt2">Dungjuiya Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">John dungjuiya chongkahoi hi </char> Inzootna Akathar suungnga inchel chongkahoi larik mili ngai karra Jisu Christa ringkhuo jarra iril larik inkhat kha eii. Larik mili ngaikha “Gospel” inti hiwa tina chu “Chongkahoi” tina eii. Larik mili ngaihi Jisu thisuo nuk-ah Matthew, Mark, Luke khat-um John in inmajia eii. John dungjuiya chongkahoi hi Tirton John in Christa injuonei makheiya kum soomkuo pheiweiya imajia eii. Hiwa larik tak-in John imajia eii timak innum 1 John, 2 John halli 3 John larik kamajiapa imajia omchan ngaile in-ang. Tiallaiya larik kamajia ngai'n hiwa phahin John hi Ephesus ah leiom inti khawa jarra hiwa Larik John dungjuiya chongkahoi hi Ephesus ah imajia lei-ete tia inlei.</para>
  <para style="ip">John in hiwa larik amajiana jarkha minthiar, khachu mi ngai'n Jisu hi Christa, Akaring Pathian Sapa eii tia ngamna inneinasik jarra eii (20:31). Hiwa kangamna in Jisu ramingnga eini'n ringna nimusik eii. Larik hi Jihudi khat-um Jihudi ka-emak ngaisik-ah imajia kha eii. John dungjuiya chongkahoi hi aleiilaak chongkahoi larik inthum ngai khale in-angmak. John in Jisu ileitho inlak chuon ngai jarra amajia, John in Jisu ileiril minkhina chong ngaikha tam majiamak. Aru etheiya kaleisuok Jisu baptism thona li Seitan in ramruok-ah Jisu matheemna jar kha-um hiwa larik hin majiamak.</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. John in chongkahoiya aphut <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Hiwa thengli John in Jisu ileitho inlak chuon angjet ngaikha amajia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:19-12:50">1:19–12:50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Hiwa thengli John in Jisu ringkhuo-ah kaleisuok chuon katamtak jarra le Jisu thina khat-um ahongring nookna jarra amalar <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 13:1-20:31">13:1–20:31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. John in Jisu ahongringsuo thengnga mi ngaidiang woikhat inlarna jarra li hiwa larik amajiana jarra arilla aminhek <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ringna Chong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Inphutna ah Chongkha aleiom; Chongkha Pathian le inleiom, halli Chongkha Pathian alei eii. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Inphutna makheiya Chongkha Pathian le inleiom. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Ang rakip-hi ama diangnga inphut Pathian in ibool eii; Ma inchel lekleiya phur inkhat-um injirra kaleiom ommak. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Amadiang ringna kha aleiom,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amadiang ringna kha aleiom</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">inleibool kha Chong khale inchunna ringna kha inleinei.</char></note> halli ringna kha miringngai war kha alei eii. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />War khan aziingna-ah awarjei, halli akaziing in warkha leimaneiimak.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Pathian diangnga inphut injuotir araming John inti miring inkhat aleiom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Matt 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-2">Luk 3:1-2</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Achongril kha miring rakip in injetnasikle ngamnasik-ah ama'n war jarra sakhi kapesik-ah ijuo eii. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Ama warkha emak; takkha war jarra sakhi kapesik kajuokha eii. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Manmasituolla kajuo mirakip ka-eel minwar amahi war akadiktak kha eii.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Ama kha manmasituolla aleiom, halli manmasituol kha ama diangnga inphut ibool eii, kha e-innum manmasituol in ama kha leijetmak. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ama'n amitak ngaidiang aleijuo, halli amitak ngai'n ama kha leidonmu. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Takkha, ama ramingnga inngamna-ah ama karalaang miring rakipdiang, Pathian sangai enasik ama'n ranak apeii. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Inmani ngaikha thiya, taksa i-ngaidonna, khat-um miring i-ngaidonna injuonei kha emu takkha Pathian diangnga inphut in eii.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Chongkha miring taksa-ah juo-injir, riangwai khat-um akadik in asip-ah einile aomsuom; Apa diangnga inphut Asa inkhatbit ena ama lurna kha eini'n nimujei.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />John in ama jarra sakhi eya aleikheek, “Hiwa miring pahi ejei kei'n ama jarra kileirilkha,” Kei nuk-ah kajuo ama'n kei neek-ah alokwiai, ajarchu kei matiang ama aleiomjei.<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ama riangwai sipna jarra eini rakip in rawaan inkhat chungnga rawaan kha nimujei. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ajarchu Dan kha Moses diangnga inphut ajuopeii, takkha riangwai khat-um akadik khachu Jisu Christa diangnga inphut kajuo kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Tuteii inkhat innum Pathian kha mumu; Asa inkhatbit, apa koolla kaom, Ama'n Pathian kha anaminjet.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist Chongpui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matt 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Jerusalemma inphut Jihudi ngai'n Thiampu ngai khat-um Levi ngai'n John diang “Tu na-eme?” tia karakel inheitir phakhan,<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Ama'n thuplekleiya “Kei Messiah kha emong” tia aleirilsuok.<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />“Angme halle?” “Nang Elijah na ebe?” intia inmani'n inleirakel. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Innidan 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Kei emong” tia ama'n aleimasang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Nang Pathian chongkachoipa na ebe?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathian chongkachoi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Messiah kajuosik-ah kaminlar khat-um kaminjet.</char></note> tia inmani'n inleirakel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Emong” tia ama'n aleimasang.<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Halle “Nang tu na-eme?” tia inmani'n inleiti. “Keini'n kanaheitir ngaidiang masangnasik nang tutak ka-eii na-intime?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Pathian chongkachoipa Isaiah ileitikha angnga John in aleiti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Kei chu ‘ramruok-ah kakheek-ah kaom miring inkhat rasa kha ka eii:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">Pumi sina sik-ah lam kha mintuunru!’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Inmani ngaikha Pharisee ngai ihongtir kha in eii. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Halli inmani'n John diang inleirakel, “Nang Christa, Elijah, emakli Pathian chongkachoipa um na-emak inle, angjarra nang in baptize nileiminthome?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />John in inmanidiang aleimasang, “Kei'n tuiya baptize kamintho, takkha nangni karra ning-ijetmak miring khat a-ngirra om. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ama hi-eii, kei kanuk-ah kajuo, takkha ama kekok kaliiksik um rahoi emong.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Hiwahi John in baptize aleiminthona Jordan tuidung raaltiang Bethany khuokhan aleisuok.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Keelngamteii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Khawa ziingkhuo warra Jisu'n amadiang iheiwa kha John in aleimuwa, aleiti, “Enru, Pathian Keelngamteii, manmasituol pumpui manu karoonsuopa! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ama hi ejei ‘Kei kanuk-ah kei neek-ah kalok miring inkhat ajuo tia kileirilkha, ajarchu kei kamatiang ama aleiomjei.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Kei kapumtak innum ama kha leijetmong; takkha ama kha Israel ngaidiang minlarnasik jarra kei'n tuiya baptize kaminthoa kajuo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Halli John in sakhi apeya aleiril, “Kei'n Ratha kha marwaan makheiya Wathu angnga juochumma khat-um ama chungnga juochuong kha kaleimu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Kei kapumtak innum ama kha leijetmong, takkha tuiya baptize minthoro tia kanajuotir ama'n keidiang ati, ‘Miring inkhatdiang Ratha khan juochumma halli ijuochuong nimu, Ama kha eii Ratha Inthiangnga baptize kamintho kha.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Kei'n kamujei halli ama hi Pathian Sapa eii tia sakhi kapeii.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Mansakhet Siamruoi ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Khawa nikhuo thengnga inlet-ah John in asiamruoi innile a-ngirra aleiom, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ama'n Jisu ihongkha aleimuwa aleiti, “Enru, Pathian Keelngamteii!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Siamruoi inni ngai'n ama'n hiwa itihi inleijet, halli inmani'n Jisu nukkha injuijei. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Jisu'n hei-inlet ah inmani'n anuk inheijui kha aleimuwa inmanidiang aleirakel, “Angkeme ning-entok?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Inmani'n amadiang inleiti, “Rabbi” (hiwa tinachu “Karu”), “Nang hunme niom?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />“Heiwa inlang juo-enru,” tia Ama'n aleimasang. Inmani'n inheiwali ama omna kha injuomu, halli phadan mili jochulpha kholei alei eii jarra inmani-um khawa nikhuo nichu Jisu le inleiom suomjei.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Inni ngai karra miring inkhat John chongril jetli Jisu nuk kajuipa kha, Simon Peter naipa Andrew alei-eii. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Ama'n a-upa Simon intongpui masa-ah aleiti, “Keini'n Messiah kha kinmujei.” (Hiwa tinachu “Christa”). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Halli ama'n Simon kha Jisu diang aheikeiruoi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Jisu'n alei-enna amadiang aleiti, “Nang John sapa Simon na-eii takkha Cephas tia innakoisik eii.” (Peter tinale in-angrip “Lungpui” tina eii).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Philip li Nathanael akoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Khawa nikhuo thengnga Jisu'n Galilee ah sisik alei-ngaidon. Ama'n Philip intongpuiya aleiti, “Kanuk najuiro.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Philip, Andrew li Peter omnakhuo Bethsaida khuopui makheiya eii. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Philip in Nathanael intongpuiya amadiang aleiti, “Moses in Dan khan ileimajia khat-um Pathian chongkachoi ngai innum inleimajia, Joseph sapa Nazareth makheiya Jisu kha keini'n kinmujei.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nathanael in amadiang aleiti, “Nazareth makheiya ang akatha hongsuok niyame?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Philip in amadiang aleiti, “Heiwa inlang juo-enro.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Jisu'n Nathanael khan amadiang iheiwa kha aleimu halli amadiang aleiti, “Enru, Inthiang Israel miring, amadiang kadikmak iteii ommak.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nathanael in Jisu diang aleiti, “Angtho tholia nang in kei ninajetme?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Philip in nakoimaklai nang in Theichangkuung nuoiya naomlai, Kei'n kanamusuojei.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Nathanael in aleimasang, “Rabbi,” “Nang Pathian Sapa na-eii! Israel ngai Reng kha na-eii!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Kei'n nang Theichangkuung nuoiya kanamu kati jarra nang in nina-ngamnabe? Nang in hiwangai neek-ah kalok angjet nalamusik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Kei'n akadik kha nangdiang kinati eii, nang in marwaan inlong halli Pathian Tirton ngai'n Miring Sapa diang inchum inkal kha namusik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Inphut 28:12</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Cana ah Moiruoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Nithum huuini Galilee suungnga kaom Cana ah moiruoi aleiom, halli Jisu nu kha-um khawa khan alei-inchel; <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Jisu um asiamruoi ngaile moiruoi khan inleikoi. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Theibomju aleihek phakhan, Jisu nu khan amadiang aleiti, “Inmani theibomju neimujei.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Eh numeisa, keili nang in ang nithosik suok ame? Kei kapha kha laheitungmak.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Anu khan suok ngaidiang aleiti, “Ama iti itikha nangni'n thoru.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Jihudi ngai sina dungjuiya insuthiang nasik lungtuibeel kuruk gallon soomni khat-um soomthum katung kakeng aleiom. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleiti, “Beel ngaihi tui minsipru.” Halli inmani'n beel ngaikha tui inleiminsip. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Ama'n inmanidiang aleiti, “Tuunchu lekkhat luok inlang halli bak-in karoonpa diang choiru.” Khawa jarra inmani'n inleichoi, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Bak-in karoonpa khan tui makheiya theibomju imin-uol kha aleimintem phakhan, humakheiyame tikha leijetmak (takkha tui kaluokpa inchu aleijet), bak-in karoonpa khan moipa akoiya <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ama diang aleiti, “Mi rakip chu theibomju kathakhet kha mansakhet insem; halli mi ngai'n inkhopphet phakhan, theibom tuichoong kha insem, takkha nangchu theibomju katha khetkha tuunkatuung naladatit!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Jisu'n mansakhet chuon inlak kha Cana Galilee ah athoa ama lurna kha amalar, halli asiamruoi ngai'n amadiang inlei-ngamnajei.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Hiwa thengnga Jisu'n anu, anai ngai, khat-um asiamruoi ngaile Capernaumma inleisi; halli khawakhan nikhuo lekkhat inleiom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Matt 4:13</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Biak-inn na aleisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12">Matt 21:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mk 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Luk 19:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Jihudi ngai Rakaanna kahoi aheitung dengpha khan, Jisu'n Jerusalemma aleisi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Suok 12:1-27</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Biak-inn khan sa, keelngam, pharbali kajour ngai, khat-um sialchuoi kamakoi ngai'n sial inlouwa inleiom kha alei-intongpui. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Ama'n ruipuon ramol aboolla sa, keelngam, khat-um sangai rakip kha Biak-inn makheiya aleipuut, sialchuoi kamakoi ngai sialpum ngaikha aleiworjuon halli inmani khamtuol ngaikha aleimalet aleimakhup. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Halli pharbali kajuor ngaidiang aleiti, “Hiwa ngaihi keisuotru! Kapa innhi nangni'n sialsum louna mun min-emaru!”<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />“Nang innsik bit-ah malung kaluut-in kei na-eijei” tia lei-injia kha ama siamruoi ngai'n inlei-ngaidon. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Minpkla 69:9</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Jihudi ngai'n amadiang inmasangnga inleiti, “Hiwa thonasik ranak kanei tihi jetna sik-ah chuon inlak keinidiang nanaminmu mator abe?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Biak-inn hi thiatru, halli nithum suungnga kei'n kaminngirsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Matt 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mk 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Jihudi ngai'n inleiti, “Hiwa Biak-inn insak hi kum soommili leiruk kaluut kha eii, halli nang in nithumma naminngirsik?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Takkha Jisu'n Biak-inn jarra ileiril khachu ama apum jarra eii. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ama'n athi makheiya ahongring khanchu, ama siamruoi ngai'n hiwahi aleitijei tia inhongngaidon, halli inmani'n Pathian chong inthiang khat-um Jisu ileiti chong ngaikha inleingamna.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miring Omchan Jisu'n ajet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ama'n Jerusalemma Rakaanna kahoi bubakna ah aleiom phakhan, Ama'n inlak chuon itho ngaikha inmuli mi katamtak in Jisu raming kha inleingamna. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Takkha Jisu apumtak in inmani ngaikha leingamnamak, ajarchu mi rakip ama'n ajet, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />halli mi inkhat jarra tu ka-ang inkhat in sakhi kapesik-ah ama diang arei ommak, ajarchu Jisu'n miring malung suungnga angme kaomkha aleijet.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu li Nicodemus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Pharisee ka-eii Jihudi ngai lamkakei araming Nicodemus inti miring inkhat aleiom. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Hiwa miringpa in zaanna Jisu diang aheiwa-ah aleiti, “Rabbi, keini'n kinjet khachu Pathian diangnga inphut kajuo ocha kha na eii; Pathian in ama kha inruoipuimak inchu, tuteii inkhat innum nang itho inlak chuon ngaihi thomatornunu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Inthiangnga Kei'n nangdiang kitihi eii: tu ka-ang in woikhat inneitharmak inchu, ama'n Pathian Rengram kha mumaneii nuni.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">woikhat; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">chungtiang makheiya.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nicodemus in amadiang aleiti, “Angtho tholi upa ka-ejei miring khan inneithar sikme?” “Anu wonsuungnga woikhat inlet-ah luutli juo-inneirit thaniabe?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n inthiangnga nangdiang kitihi eii, tu ka-ang in tuiya khat-um Ratha-ah inneitharmak inchu, ama'n Pathian Rengram kha luuttheinuni. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Taksa ah inneikha taksa eii, halli Ratha ah inneikha ratha eii. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Kei'n nangdiang kinatihi nang ngakmaro, nang woikhat na-inneitharsik eii. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">woikhat; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">chungtiang makheiya.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Thiraang khan araangnazoot rei araang; halli nang in arasa kha najet, takkha humakheiya kaheiwame emakli huntiangme isi nang in jetmakche. Ratha ah innei miring rakip ngaikha khawa ka-ang eii.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nicodemus in amadiang aheimasang, “Hiwahi angtho tholia ethei sikme?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Nang Israel ngai ocha na-epumma hiwa ngaihi nilajetmakbe? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kitihi eii, keini'n kin-ijetkha kinril khat-um kin imukhan sakhi eii; takkha keini sakhi kha nangni'n leimakchu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Kei'n manmasituolla kitho chuon ngaikha nangnidiang kariljei halli nangni'n ngamnamakchu, Marwaanna kaom jarra karil inle angtho thoa ningngamnasik me? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Tuteii inkhat-um chungtiang kalla marwaanna kasi ommu takkha marwaan makheiya kajuochum Miring Sapa khabit eii.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hi chonghi alam 21 makheiya lei injomritna cha.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Moses in neelramma sumsen maruul kha ikadomsaang angnga, Miring Sapa kha-um inkadom saangsik eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Teelna 21:9</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />khachu Amadiang ka-ngamna rakip in hektik kaboi ringna inmunasik eii. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ajarchu Pathian in manmasituol kha hituk aminriang khachu Asapa inkhatbit kha ama'n anapeii, amadiang kangamnatak miring khan thina mununi takkha kumsoot ringna kha amusik eii. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Pathian in Asapa kha manmasituol chong katansik ijuotir emak, takkha manmasituol kakatansik ijuotir kha eii.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Amadiang ngamna kanei mi ngaichu chongtan omnuni; takkha amadiang ngamna keneimak mi ngaichu chong atansuojei, ajarchu Pathian Sapa inkhatbit ramingkha ngamnamu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Chongtan kha hiwahi ejei, khachu War kha manmasituolla ajuojei, takkha mi ngai inchu akaziing kha war neek-ah inleimanuom, ajarchu inmani chuontho ngaikha leidikmak. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Chuon kadikmak katho ngai'n war kha inleimatir, ajarchu inmani kadikmak chuonkha inlarte intia wardiang heiwamu. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Takkha akadik katho ngai'n inmani itho chuon ngaikha Pathian kinjuiya kintho eii tia malarnasik ah wardiang inheiwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu li John</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Hiwa thengnga, Jisu khat-um asiamruoi ngai'n Judea ramsuungnga inleisi, khawakhan ama'n apha bongkhat inmanile aleiomma khat-um baptize aleitho. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />John um Aenon inti Salim le innai munkhan baptize aleimintho, ajarchu khawa munkhan tui katamtak aleiom. Mipui ngai'n amadiang inheiwa halli ama'n baptize aleimintho.<verse eid="JHN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ajarchu khawa phakhan John mikhumna ah laleidamu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 14:13">Matt 14:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:16">Mk 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Khawa jarra John siamruoi ngaili Jihudi ngai'n<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jihudi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat achu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jihudi lekkhat </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tia injia.</char></note> biaklam dungjuiya insuthiangna jarra murruolsiak inlei-intho. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Khantia inmani'n John diang inheiwa ah inleiti, “Rabbi, nang in ama jarra nileiril, Jordan raaltiang makheiya nangle inruoi miring pakha hin baptize aminthoa om, halli miring rakip amadiang insi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />John in aleimasang, “Marwaanna inphut injuopeii elekleiya tu inkhat innum iteii mutheinunu.<verse eid="JHN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />‘Kei Christa kha emong, takkha keichu ama matiang najuotir kha ka-eii, kei'n kitihi’ nangni ningpumtak in kei sakhi ning ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jn 1:20</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Moinu kha moipa ta-eii; moipa sappui pa'n a-ngirra moipa rasa kha arangaiya ajetpha khan arok. Hinthoa kei rokna kha huui tungjei. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ama chu kheella aloksik eii takkha keichu kajuosiinsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Marwaan makheiya Kajuopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Chungtiang Makheiya kajuo ama'n mi rakip neek-ah alokwiai. Nuoipil chungnga kaom mikha nuoipilchung mi eii, khat-um nuoipilchung jarra ama'n aril, takkha marwaanna inphut kajuo ama'n mi rakip neek-ah alok. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Ama'n imujei khat-um ijet ngaikha aril, kha e-innum ama sakhi kha tuteii innum leikeiluutmu. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Takkha ama sakhi kakeiluut miring khan Pathian hi adik tia jetnabi ada. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Pathian ijuotir miring khan Pathian chong ngaikha aril, ajarchu Pathian in Ratha kha akasip-ah apeii.<verse eid="JHN 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Apa khan Asapa kha aminriang halli angrakip ngaikha ama kutchungnga ranak apejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Matt 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10:22</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Asapa diang ngamna kanei miring khan hektik kaboi ringna kha amujei; Asapa kajuimak mi ngaikha ringna mununu, takkha Pathian raangna nuoiya inomsik eii.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu li Samaritan Numeisanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Jisu'n John neek-ah siamruoi tamwiai baptize amintho tikha Pharisee ngai'n inleijet, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ka etakchu, baptize kamintho kha Jisu lei-emak takkha asiamruoi ngai in-eii. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Hiwa chonghi Jisu'n aleijet phakhan, Ama'n Judea mathaanna Galilee ah aleikirnook; <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />halli Samaria ram rakaanli sisik kha alei eii.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Samaria ah Sychar inti khuopui, Jacob in asapa Joseph diang ileipeii leimun koolla aheiwa. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Inphut 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Josh 24:32</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Jacob tuikhur kha khawakhan aleiom, Jisu'n akasikha aleipoongnga, tuikhur koolla alei in-ong. Kani indingdeng phakhan alei eii.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Samaritan numeisa inkhat tui kachoi aheiwa, khat-um Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleiti, “Keidiang insik-ah tui napero.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ajarchu asiamruoi ngaikha khopuiya baksik-ah bakphur karacho inleisi.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Samaritan numeisanu khan aleimasang, “Angjarra Jihudi nang in, Samaritan numeisa keidiang tui insik-ah ninanime?” ajarchu Jihudi ngai chu Samaritan ngai'n inliingna rabing khat-um kheeng inliingnamu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jihudi ngai chu Samaritan ngai'n inliingna rabing khat-um kheeng inliingnamu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jihudi ngai chu Samaritan ngaile inlopnasik iteii arei ommak.</char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="EZR 4:1">Ezra 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1-2">Neh 4:1-2</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Nang in Pathian kutchoi kha naleijetngai suok-ah khat-um nangdiang tui insik-ah kanani amahi naleijet inchu, nang in amadiang naleinisik eii, halli ama'n nangdiang ringna tuikha analeipesik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Numeisanu khan aleiti, “Ocha” “Nangchu tuiluok nasik neimakche, tuikhur hi inthuuk. Hu makheiya khawa ringna tuikha naleisik me? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Hiwa tuikhur kanaleipeii, ama sangai khat-um asadon rakip ngai'n in-in, keini kinpa Jacob neek-ah nalokwiaibe?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “ Hiwa tui ka-in miring rakip khachu woikhat araalpinook sik eii, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Takkha kei'n kapesik tuikha ka-in ama khachu woikhat inlet-ah tuikaraal omnuni. Kei'n amadiang kapesik tui khan amadiang tuiring inchangta kumsoot ringna kha esik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Numeisanu khan amadiang aleiti “Karu, khawa tuikha keidiang napero! Tichu kei'n woikhat tuikaraal ommaknasik, khat-um woikhat tui kachoi kaheiwa maknasik.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleiti, “Si inlang naruothar juokoiro, halli heikirnook ro.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Numeisanu in aleimasang, “Kei karuothar ommak.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Jisu'n aleiti, “Nang in kei karuothar ommak inthiangnga nati. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ajarchu nang pasal ra-ngadiang inn naneijei, halli tuun tuunna niompui pasal kha-um nang naruothar emak. Nang in inthiang kha nariljei.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Numeisanu khan aleimasang, Karu, “Kei'n kamujei nang Pathian chongkachoi na eii.” <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />“Keini kinpi kinpu ngai'n hiwa chingbung hin Pathian chubei inleitho, takkha nangni Jihudi ngai inchu Jerusalem khankeeng Pathian chubei nithonasik mun ningti.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleiti, “Numeisa, Keidiang ngamnaro, miring ngai'n Pa Pathian kha hiwa chingbung emakli Jerusalem ma chubei inthomaknasik aphakha aheiwasik eii. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Nangni'n ning ijetmak kha chubei ningtho; takkha keini chu kin-ijetkha chubei kintho, ajarchu sanminringna kha Jihudi diangnga inphut kajuo eii. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Takkha aphakha ahongjei khat-um tuun aphakha ejei, inthiangnga chubei katho ngai'n Pa Pathian kha ratha khat-um akadik ah chubei inthosik eii, Pa Pathian khan inmani ka-ang ngai'n chubei inhongtho kha a-entok. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Pathian chu Ratha eii, khat-um amadiang chubei katho ngai'n ratha khat-um akadik ah chubei inthosik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Numeisanu khan amadiang aleiti, “Kei'n kajet Messiah (Christa tia inkoi) kha ajuosik eii, Ama'n ajuo phakhan, keini diang angrakip kha narilpisik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleimasang, “Nangle inbiak-ah kaom keihi ama kha ka eii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Khawapha takkhan asiamruoi ngaikha inheitung, khat-um ama'n numeisanu khale inlei-inbiak inmupha khan asiamruoi ngai'n inleingak, takkha tuteii innum, “Angme nimanuom?” emakli, “Angjarra numeisanu hile thurchi nithome?” tia leirakelmu.<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Numeisanu kha atuibeel da-ah, khuopui tiang aleisi, halli mipui ngaidiang aleirilpi, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Heiwaru, kei ileitho rakip jarra karilwiak miring kha juo-enru. Ama hi Messiah lei-emak niabe?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Inmani ngai'n khuopui inmathaanna Jisu diang inheiwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Khawa phakhan, “Karu, bakphur lekkhat bakro!” tia asiamruoi ngai'n ama kha inleimatheem.<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Takkha ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni ijetmak bakphur kha kei kanei.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Khawa jarra asiamruoi ngai'n inkhatli khatdiang inlei inti, “Tu miring inkhat in amasik bakphur heikachoipi inombe?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Kei kabu chu” “Kei kanajuotirpa imanuom katho khat-um ama chuon huui kamintung kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Nangni'n ‘Tha mili esuoli lei rakhoolpha eii timak chuwabe?’ Takkha kei'n nangni diang kanati, khuo thir-inlang leirajei kha enru; lei ngaikha aminjei khat-um lei rakhoolpha ejei! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Lei karakhool mi kha arakhool man achang halli akara kha kumsoot ringna sik-ah akhomchun; ajarchu kawor pa-um karakhool pa-um inrok suomnasik eii. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Chongngil ileiti kha adik, ‘Miring khat in aru awor halli miring inkhat in arakhool.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Kei'n nangni itho ka-emak chuon munkhan akara karakhool sik-ah kinatir ejei; aleiilaak mi ngai'n chuon inleithojei, halli inmani chuonleitho khan nangni'n ninghoi kha eii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />“Kei ileitho rakip ama'n atiwiak” iti numeisanu sakhi jarra khawa khopuiya kaom Samaritan mi katamtak in Jisu diang inlei-ngamna. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Samaritan mi ngai'n amadiang inheiwa phakhan, inmanile omsuomrui tia amadiang inleimatheem, halli Jisu'n inmani ngaile khawa munkhan nini aleiom.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Halli ama chongril khan miring katamtak-um ngamna inleineinook. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Halli inmani'n numeisanu diang inleiti, “Tuunchu keini'n kinngamnajei, nang in nati jarra emak, takkha keini kinpum tak-in amadiang kinrangaijei, khat-um keini'n kinjetjei khachu amahi inthiangnga manmasituol kakatanpa kha a-eii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Kalok kalianpa Sapa Amindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Khawa nini thengnga, Jisu'n Galilee ah aleisi. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Ma apumtak in aleiti, “Pathian chongkachoi ngaikha inramtak inchu khoya thomu.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Matt 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk 4:24</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 4:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Khawa jarra ama'n Galilee aheitung phakhan, Galilee mi ngai'n ama kha katha-ah inleidon, ajarchu Jerusalemma rakaanna kahoi khan inmani ngaikha inleisi khat-um ama'n kahoi suungnga ileitho rakip ngaikha inleimu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Jn 2:23</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Halli Jisu'n Galilee suungnga Cana inti, ama'n tuikha theibomju aleimin-uolna ramkhan inlet-ah aheiwa. Halli Capernaumma asapa kanapi kalok kalian miring inkhat aleiom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Jn 2:1-11</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 4:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ama'n Jisu kha Judea makheiya Galilee ah aheiwa tikha aleijet phakhan, ama'n Jisu diang asiya ajuoti, kasapa najomindam piro tia chubei aleitho, ajarchu ama kha thisik thoa omjei. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Chuon inlak khat-um ngak kaom ningmu maklaiseng nangni'n ngamnanutun.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Kalok kalianpa'n Jisu diang aleiti, “Karu, kasapa thima-ah keile inruoiya situi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Sitro; nang nasapa aringsik eii!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Mipa khan Jisu'n amadiang iti chongkha ngamna ah aleisi. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Inn tiang asina lamma ama suok ngai'n intongpuiya, halli nasapa aringjei tia inleitipi.<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ama'n inmani diang aleirakel asapa ihongdam kha phadan angjet chulpha khan me, khat-um inmani'n inleimasang, “Miyanni suun phadan inkhat khan eii ritun khan ama imathaankha.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Apa khan aleijet khachu khawa phadan khan eii Jisu'n ama diang ileiti, “Nang nasapa aringsik eii.” Halli ma apumtak khat-um ama insuungkhur in inleingamna.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Judea makheiya Galilee ah aheiwasuo thengnga hiwahi Jisu'n woini huuina ileitho chuon inlak kha eii.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tuikuongnga Mindamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Hiwa thengnga, Jisu'n Jerusalemma Jihudi ngai kahoi sik-ah aleisi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Jerusalemma Keelngam Kot koolla pham ra-nga-ah inmakhu tuikuong inkhat aleiom; Hebrew ngai chongnga Bethzatha inti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Keelngam kot koolla ... tuikuong; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">keelngam kot koolla ... amun.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Amit kacho, keii kakiak, apum kathi khat-um akana katam tak-in tuikuong luutna lamma inleizaal. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Inmani'n tui innik kha inleingaak, ajarchu tui innikna racham Pumi tirton in tuikuong suungnga aluut-ah khat-um tui kha aleikachok. Tui hongkachoksuo nuk-ah tuikuong suungnga kaluut masa akana mi kha ileiroontak rirai makheiya aleidam. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Kum soomthum leiriat kanajei miring inkhat aleiom. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Jisu'n ama kha khawakhan azaalla ileiom kha aleimu, khat-um khawa miring pakha anana hongsoot theijei tihi ama'n aleijet phakhan Jisu'n “Nang nadam zootbo?” tia amadiang aleirakel.<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Akanapa khan Jisu diang aleimasang, “Karu, tui hong innik phakhan tuikuongnga kanaruoisik tuteii ommu; kei'n chumnasik kaheitho phakhan, miring khat-in naluutdel masa.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Jisu'n ama diang aleiti, “Intheiro, napher kha ruut-inlang, halli siro.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Khawapha takkhan mipa kha aleidam; apher kha aruut-ah aleisi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Hiwa aleisuokna nikhuo kha Jihudi ngai sernikhuo (Sabbath) alei eii. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Jihudi lamkakei ngai'n akadamjei mipadiang inleiti, “Sabbath eii, eini Sinadan dungkajuiya nang in napher niraput kha dan akoi.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="NEH 13:9">Neh 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Jer 17:21</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Takkha ama'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Kei kanamindam mipa'n kapher ruut-inlang siro analeiti.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Inmani'n amadiang inleirakel, “Nangdiang napher ruut-inlang siro kanaleiti miring kha tume?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Takkha akadamjei mipa khan ama kha tume leijetmak, ajarchu Jisu'n aleisuok deljei, khat-um khawa munkhan mipui katamtak inleiom.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Khawa thengnga, Jisu'n mipa kha Biak-inn khan intongpuiya ama diang aleiti, “Enro, tuun nang nadamjei; kheella nachungnga kathamak suokmaknasik, manu thokhaimaro, emak inchu katha makthei nangdiang suokthei eii.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Halli mipa khan asiya kei kanamindam pakha Jisu eii tia ma'n Jihudi chuonkaroon ngaidiang ajuorilsuok. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Jisu'n Sabbath nikhuoni hiwa chuon atho jarra Jihudi ngai'n Jisu kha poong-raalna inleipeii. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Takkha Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Kapa khan tuunkatuung chuon thocheiya om, halli kei-um chuon kitho eii.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Hiwa chong jarra Jihudi chuonkaroon ngai'n Jisu kha kheella thatna sik-ah inlei entok; ajarchu Sabbath imakoi khabit emak-ah, takkha Pathian kha apa eii tia ama'n aleiti, apum takkha Pathian le in-angpui.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sapa Thomatorna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanati: Asapa khan iteii-um atheinuoa thomatormak, Apa itho imu ngaikhabit ama'n atho; Apa itho kha, Asapa innum itho eii. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Ajarchu Apa khan Asapa kha aminriang halli apum tak-in itho ngai rakip kha Asapa diang aminmu, nangni'n ningngak domnasik hineek-ah kalok thonasik-ah amadiang alaminmusik eii. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Apa khan akathi ngai aminringnga ringkhuo ipenook angnga, Asapa innum ipezoot mi ngaidiang ringna apeii. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Apa khan tuteii diang-um chong tanmak, takkha Asapa diang chongtan nasik ranak rakip ama'n apejei, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Apa diang khoya intho angnga mi rakip in Asapa kha khoya inthosik eii. Asapa khoya kathomak ama khan Asapa kajuotir Apa kha-um khoya kathomak eii.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kati: Kei kachong karangai khat-um kei kanajuotir amadiang inngamna mi khan kumsoot ringna anei, ama chungnga chongtan omnuni, takkha kathiya inphut ringna kha inrakaanjei. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kati: akathi ngai'n Pathian Sapa rasa kha injet nasik, halli akajet ngai'n inhongring nasik-ah aphakha aheiwasik eii, halli tuun aphakha ejei. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Apa'n ringna inei angnga, Ama'n Asapa diang-um apum tak-ah ringna aneinasik azootpi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Khat-um Ama'n Asapa diang chongtan nasik ranak apejei, ajarchu amahi Miring Sapa kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Hiwa hin nangni ngakmaru; Akathi mi rakip in thaankhur makheiya ama rasa injet nasik apha kha ajuojei<verse eid="JHN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Halli akatha katho ngai'n inthaan makheiya hongsuok inta ringna inneisik eii, halli kathamak katho ngai'n chongtan nasik-ah inhongringsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu jarra Sakhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Kei karanak-ah iteii thomatormong; Pathian in chong tanro iti-ngai bitkha Kei'n chong katan, halli kei chongtanhi adik, ajarchu kei imanuom kha kei thosik ngaidonmong, takkha kei kanajuotir ama imanuom kha katho.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Kei kapum taksik sakhi kape inchu, Kei sakhi hi dikmak; <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Takkha mi inkhat kei sakhi ka-e om, halli kei'n kajet khachu ama'n kei jarra iril ngaikha adik.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Nangni'n John diang ningheitir, halli John in inmanidiang akadik kha aleirilpi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Jn 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Kei'n mi ngai sakhi kilei emak, takkha Kei'n hiwa katina ajarchu nangni'n ringna ningmunasik eii. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />John hi war kanapeii sariakmei kakai kha alei eii, halli nangni'n ama warkhan apha bongkhat hoinasik-ah ningkadang. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Takkha kei ipeii sakhi hichu John ta neek-ah kalok eii; kei thosik-ah Kapa inapeii chuon ngai, khat-um kei itho chuon ngai khan keihi Apa inajuotir eii tia amalar.”<verse eid="JHN 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Halli kei kanajuotir kapa in kei jarra sakhi apeii. Nangni'n ama rasa woikhat-um lajetmakchu khat-um ama meel lamumakchu, <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Matt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />halli nangni'n ama chongkha ningmalungnga reiimakchu, ajarchu ama ijuotir miringkha ngamnamakchu. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Nangni'n Chong inthiang kha ning-entok, ajarchu nangni'n khawa khan hektik kaboi ringna kinmu eii ningti; halli khawa Pathian chong kha eii, kei jarra sakhi ka-eii; <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />kha e-innum nangni'n ringna ningmunasik keidiang heiwazoot makchu.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Manmasi ngai'n naminpaak kha kei manuommong, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />takkha kei'n kajet, khachu nangni ningmalung suungnga Pathian minriang nakha neimakchu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Kei'n Kapa ramingnga kajuo, halli nangni'n kei nazootmakchu; takkha miringkhat apumtak thomatorna ramingnga ajuo-inchu, nangni'n ama chu ningdonsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Pathian diangnga kajuo minpaak nakha entoklekleiya inkhatli inkhat inpaak kha ningmanuom inle angtho tholi ngamna ningneisik me? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Kei'n Kapa maikuungnga nangni kanaril sesik eii tia ngaidonmaru. Nangni'n ngamna ningnei Moses kha-eii nangni kanaril sesik. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Nangni'n Moses kha inthiangnga ningleingamna inchu, nangni'n kei-um ningna ngamnasik eii, ajarchu Moses in kei jarra aleimajia. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Takkha ama ileimajia kha ningngamnamak inchu, angtho tholi kei kachong ningngamnasik me?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Miring Lising Ra-nga Awai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matt 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Hiwa thengnga, Jisu'n Tiberias tuipui, Galilee tuidiil raaltiang rakaanna aleisi. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Halli mipui'n ama nukkha inheijui, ajarchu inmani ngai'n chuon inlak tholi akana ngai imindam kha inleimu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Jisu'n chingbung aleikalla asiamruoi ngaile alei in-ong. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Khawa phakhan Jihudi ngai Rakaanna kahoi kha aleinaijei. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Jisu'n alei-enna mipui katamtak amadiang inheiwa kha aleimu, halli ma'n Philip diang aleiti, “Hiwa mipui bak kahunsik bakphur hi angtho tholi niracho sikme?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Ma'n hiwa itihi Philip malung ensik tia iril eii; ama'n angme athosik inthiangnga aleijet.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Philip in amadiang aleimasang, “Dangka pum rajani innum inmani rakip in lekteii baksik-ah rachosik hunnuni.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7. </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dangka pum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dangka pum khat in chounmi khat nisuokhat chountho man eii (enru Matt 20:2)</char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Asiamruoi inkhat Simon Peter naipa Andrew in amadiang aleiti, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Pasal naipang inkhat satun waipool ra-nga li nga inni kachoi khat hin om, takkha hiwa mipui diangchu angsemma semminname?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Jisu'n aleiti “Mi rakip kha min-ongru.” halli khawa munkhan chinthou katamtak aleimoong; halli mipui'n inlei in-ong; pasal miring lising ra-nga inlei eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Jisu'n waipool kha aleiya Pathian aleiminpaak, halli khawa khanna in-ong mi rakipdiang inleisem. Khawa angnga nga kha-um khan thoa inleisem, halli mi rakip in inbak maneii laiseng inleibak. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Mi rakip in inleihun phakhan, Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Alek kaliam ngaikha khoomchunru; eini'n iteii minmangmui.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Khawa jarra siamruoi ngai'n mipui bakbang satun waipool ra-nga makheiya kaliam rakip kha inkhoom chunna thumluk soomleini inleiminsip.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Mipui ngai'n Jisu itho inlak chuon kha inleimu phakhan, Inmani'n inleiti, “Inthiangnga hiwahi Pathian chongkachoi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14. </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Pathian chongkachoi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enru 1:21.</char></note> manmasituolla kajuosik miring kha eii!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Inmani'n heiwa inta azootmak pumma naruoi inta reng innaminchangsik ejei tikha Jisu'n ajet-ah; Jisu'n alooiya chingbungtiang atheinuoa aleisijei.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Tuichungnga sina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matt 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Kholei ahei ephakhan, Jisu siamruoi ngaikha tuidiil khan inleichum, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />rakuong suungnga inleiluut, khat-um tuidiil rakaanli Capernaum tiang inleisi, zaan aheiluut katung Jisu'n inmani diang laheiwa titmak. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Thikaraang kangar aheiraangnga tuipui kha aleiminnik. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Asiamruoi ngai'n miles inthum emakli mili katung rakuong inleisep phakhan inmani'n tuichungnga Jisu'n rakuong kooltiang iheiwa kha inleimu, halli inmani ngai'n inleichi. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Takkha Jisu'n inmanidiang aleiti “Kei ka eii; chimaru.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Halli inmani'n ama kha karok-ah rakuong suungnga inleikeiluut, halli khawapha takkhan rakuong kha intungnasik muongkhan aleituungjei.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mipui'n Jisu inlei-entok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ziingkhuo warra tuidiil raalkhat tiangnga kaom mipui ngai'n rakuong inkhatbit omjei tikha inleijet, halli Jisu kha asiamruoi ngaikhale inrouimak takkha siamruoi ngaichu insisuojei tikha-um inleijet. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Pumi'n Pathian aminpaak suoli inmani'n waipool inleibakna mun tuikham koolkhan Tiberias makheiya rakuong lekkhat inheiwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Mipui ngai'n Jisu khat-um asiamruoi ngaikha khawakhan ommujei ti inleimu phakhan, inmani um rakuong ngaikhan inluut-ah Capernaumma Jisu ka-entok inleisi.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Ringna Waipool eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Mipui ngai'n ama kha tuidiil raalkhat tiang i-omkha inmu phakhan, inmani'n ama diang inleiti, “Karu, angtik pha-ah hiwahin niheiwame?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kati: inlak chuon ningmu jarra kei ningna entok emak takkha waipool kakhop-ah ningbak jarra kei ningna entok eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Kamangthei bu sik-ah chuon thomaru; takkha Miring Sapa'n nangnidiang anapesik hektik kaboi ringna busik ah chuon thoru. Ajarchu Apa Pathian in izoot jetnabi kha ama chungnga adeengjei.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Halli inmani'n amadiang inleiti, “Pathian chuon thonasik-ah, keini'n angme kinthosik?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Pathian chuonkha hiwahi eii, khachu Pathian in ijuotir amadiang ngamnaru.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Inmani'n amadiang inleiti, “Halle angkachang inlak chuonme nang in nathosik halli keini'n kinmuli nang kinna-ngamnasik hi?<verse eid="JHN 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Nipi nipu ngai'n neelramma manna inleibak; hintia lei-injia ‘Ama'n marwaan makheiya inmanidiang baksik ah waipool aleipeii.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Suok 16:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Minpkla 78:24</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleiti, “Kei'n inthiangnga nangni diang kanati, marwaan makheiya waipool kanaleipeii kha Moses emak, takkha marwaan makheiya inthiang waipool kanape kha kei Kapa eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Pathian waipool khachu marwaan makheiya kajuo khat-um manmasituol diang ringna kapeii ama kha eii.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Inmani'n amadiang inleiti “Pumi, hiwa waipoolhi keinidiang apha rakip ah napero.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleiti, “Kei ringna waipool kha ka eii, Kei kadiang kaheiwa miring kha wonkachaam ti omnuni; halli keidiang kangamna ama khan woikhat inlet-ah tuikaraal omnuni. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Takkha kei'n nangnidiang kanati khachu nangni'n kei ningnamujei innum keidiang nangamna makchu. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Kapa'n keidiang inapeii rakip ngaikha keidiang inheiwasik eii, halli Kei'n tuteii inkhat-um keidiang kaheiwa ngaikha angtikteii puutnuning. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Ajarchu kei'n marwaan makheiya kalungdou kathosik ah kijuo kha emak takkha kei kanajuotir ama racham kathosik ah kijuo kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Kei kanajuotir ama lungdou kha hiwahi eii, khachu keidiang inapejei ngaikha tuteii inkhat-um Kei'n minmang nuning, takkha ahekna nikhuoni inmani kha minringsik ti hi-eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kapa imanuom khachu hiwahi eii, Asapa kamu khat-um ama diang ka-ngamna rakip in kumsoot ringna inmusik; Halli kei'n ama kha ahekna nikhuoni kaminringsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />“Kei marwaan makheiya kajuo waipool kha ka eii” atipi jarra Jihudi ngai'n ama chungnga leizootmu. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Inmani'n inleiti, “Hiwahi eini'n anuli apa nijet Joseph sapa Jisu, emak abe? Angtho tholi, halle, tuuntak ‘Kei marwaan makheiya kijuo eii itime?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Nangni'n suungnga kei jarra num ningti kha daru. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kei kanajuotir Kapa'n ama kha keidiang aheiruoimak inchu, tuteii innum keidiang heiwatheimu; halli kei'n ahekna nikhuoni khan ama kha kaminringsik eii.<verse eid="JHN 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Pathian chongkachoi ngai larik khan injiajei, ‘Inmani rakip ngaikha Pathian in aminchusik eii.’ Apa Pathian diangnga karangai khat-um ka-inchu rakip ngai'n keidiang inheiwa. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54:13</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Pathian makheiya kajuo ama'n elekleiya tuteii miring inkhat innum Apa Pathian lamumu; ama khabit eii Pa Pathian kamu. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kanati, kangamna mi khan kumsoot ringna kha anei. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Kei ringna waipool kha ka eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Ningpi ningpu ngai'n neelramma manna inleibak halli inmani'n inleithijei. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Mi inkhat in abakli thimaknasik marwaan makheiya kajuo ringna waipool kha hi-eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Kei marwaan makheiya kajuo akaring waipool kha ka eii, hiwa waipool kabaktak miring kha, kumsoot aringsik eii; halli Kei'n manmasituol ringna sik-ah kapesik waipool khachu kei kataksa kha eii.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Jihudi ngai'n inmani suungnga murruolsiak inleithoa inleiti “Angtho tholi hiwa miring pa'n ataksa eini baksik-ah anape matorsikme?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleiti, “Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanati, nangni'n Miring Sapa taksa kha ningbakmak khat-um ama thisen kha ning-inmak inchu, nangni ningpumma ringna ommak; <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Kei kataksa kabak khat-um kei kathisen ka-in ngaikha kumsoot ringna kha innei, halli kei'n ahekna nikhuoni khan inmani kha kaminringsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kei kataksa hi inthiang bu kha eii; halli kei kathisen hi inthiang insik kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Kei kataksa kabak khat-um kei kathisen ka-in ama khan keidiang inchat lekleiya aom, halli kei'n amadiang kaom. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Akaringchak Kapa'n kei anajuotir, khat-um kei'n kapa jarra kiring angnga, Kei kataksa kabak miring khan kei jarra aringsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Hiwahi eii, marwaan makheiya kajuo waipool kha; ningpi ningpu ngai'n inleibak suonuk inleithi ka-ang emak, hiwa waipool kabak miring khachu kumsoot ringna aneisik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Jisu'n hiwa chongngaihi Capernaumma kaom Synagogue ah ileiminchu kha eii.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumsoot Ringna Chong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ama siamruoi katamtak ngai'n hiwahi inlei rangaiya inleiti, “Hiwahi kangarthei minchuna chong eii; tu juimatorsik me?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Takkha Jisu'n hiwa jarra asiamruoi ngai'n num intikha aleijet-ah, inmanidiang aleitipi, “Hiwa hi'n nangnidiang kesuina ebejei? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Halle, nangni'n Miring Sapa kha mansa-ah aleiomna munkhan ikal ningmu inle angme ning-ngaidonsik? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Ringna kanape kha Ratha eii, taksa hichu iteii nemna ommak. Kei'n nangnidiang kileiril chong ngaikha ratha khat-um ringna kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Takkha nangni karra kangamnamak mi lekkhat ningom.” Jisu'n inphutna makheiya tu ngaime kangamna maksik khat-um tu inme ama kajuorsik kha aleijet. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Halli ama'n aleiti, “Hiwa jarra eii kei'n nangni diang kileiti, khachu Apa Pathian in ama kha izootpi elekleiya tuteii-um keidiang heiwa matormu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Hiwa makheiya anukkajui katamtak in nuk inmalet-ah amale sisuom khaimujei. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Jisu'n soomleini ngaidiang aleiti, “Nangni-um nuk ningmalet-ah ningsizoot be?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simon Peter in amadiang aleimasang, “Pumi, tudiang keini'n sinung ngame? kumsoot ringna chongkha nangdiang om; <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Matt 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mk 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luk 9:20</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 6:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Halli keini'n nanghi Pathian diang makheiya kajuo Inthiang kha na eii tihi kin-ngamnajei khat-um kinjetjei.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Kei'n nangni soomleini kinakadang emak abe? halli ningkarra miring inkhatchu Seitan eii” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Simon Iscariot sapa Judas jarra eii Jisu'n iril, ajarchu soomleini ngai karra Judas in Pumi ajuorsik eii.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu khat-um Anai ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Hiwa thengnga, Jisu'n Galilee suungnga aleileeng; Ama'n Judea ramsuungnga leisizootmak, ajarchu khawa khanna kaom Jihudi ngai'n ama kha thatnasik inlei-entok.<verse eid="JHN 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Jihudi ngai Soongmachumna Kahoi kha aleinai, <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Levi 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Innidan 16:13</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Khawa jarra ama unai ngai'n amadiang inleiti, nang itho chuon ngaikha nasiamruoi ngai'n inmunasik-ah “Hiwa munhi mathaan inlang Judea-ah sitro. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Tuteii miring innum araming aminsizoot inchu achuontho kha thupmak. Hiwa chuon ngaihi nithojei keengnga, manmasituol pumpui diang nang injettro.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ama a-u anai takngai innum amadiang leingamnamu.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleiti, “Kei kapha kha laheitungmak, takkha nangni sikchu aphakha omchei. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Manmasituol in nangnichu namatir theinunu, takkha keichu innamatir, ajarchu Kei'n inchuontho ngaikha dikmak tia sakhi kapeii. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Nangni kahoi khan sitru; hiwa kahoi hin Kei sinuning,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:8. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kei sinuning; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscripts lekkhat in hin ti </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kei lasimong.</char></note> ajarchu kei kapha kha laheitungmak.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Hiwahi atia ama'n Galilee ah aleiom.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Soongmachumna Kahoi khan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Takkha anai ngai'n kahoi munkhan insisuo thengnga, Jisu um inlarleiya ruuk-ah aleisi. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Jihudi ngai'n ama kha kahoi munkhan “Ma hun omme?” tia inlei-entok.<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Mipui karra ama jarra tamthei num inleiti. Miring lekkhat in “Amahi mi katha eii” inleiti, lekkhat ngai'n “Emak,” “Ama'n mi katamtak lamleiitiang akeiruoi” inleiti. <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Takkha inmani'n Jihudi ngaikha inleichi jarra tuteii innum inlarra ama jarra leirilmu.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Kahoi alai ahongtungdeng phakhan Jisu'n Biak-inn tiang asiya khat-um kaminchu aleiphut. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Jihudi ngai'n inngak-ah inleiti, “Angtho tholi hiwa mi'n inchu lekleiya hituk ijetme?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Kei iminchuhi kei kata emak, takkha kei kanajuotir ama ta kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Tu ka-ang mi'n Pathian lungdou thosik-ah akadang inchu, ama'n kei minchunahi Pathian makheiya kajuobe emakli kei katheinuo ta kirilbe tikha ajetsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Ama thomatorna ranak-ah karil ama khan apumtak inpaaknasik aril; takkha ama kajuotirpa minpaak sik-ah ka-entok miring khachu akadik kha eii, khat-um amadiang katuunmak iteii ommak. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Moses in Sinadan inaleipeii emak abe? takkha nangni tuteii innum Sinadan kha juimakchu. Angjarra nangni'n kei nathatnasik ning-entokme?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Mipui ngai'n inleimasang, “Nang nasuungnga raikhuo om! Tu in nang nathat sik-ah na-entok ame?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Kei'n chuon inlak inkhat katho, halli nangni rakip ngai'n ningngak.<verse eid="JHN 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Moses in nangnidiang wun tanru tia chong analeipeii (Moses diangnga inphut emak takkha nangni ningpi ningpu ngaidiang makheiya eii), halli nangni'n pasal naikha Sabbath nikhuoni wun ningtan. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Levi 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:10">Inphut 17:10</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Pasal nai khan Sabbath nikhuoni wun intan khat-um Moses Sinadan kha koimak inle, angjarra Kei'n miring inkhat Sabbath nikhuoni apum kamindamli nangni'n keidiang ningraangme? <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Jn 5:9</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Meel en-inlang chongkatan kha emaru, takkha akadik khan chong tanru.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Messiah ebe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Jerusalem makheiya miring lekkhat ngai'n inleiti, “Hiwa mipa hi emak abe inmani ngai'n thatsik-ah inlei-entok? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Enru! Ama'n mipui karra arilla aom, khat-um inmani ngai'n amadiang iteii timu! thomatorna ranak kanei inmani ngai'n inthiangnga amahi Messiah eii tia leijetjeinubo? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Hiwa mipa hichu humakheiya iheiwame eini'n nijet, takkha Messiah ajuokaal khanchu, tuteii innum humakheiya ijuome jetnunu.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Jisu'n Biak-inna iminchule inruoiya inringnga aleiti, “Nangni'n kei ningnajet abe, khat-um kei humakheiya kijuome ningnajet abe? Kei kapumtak thomatorna ranak-ah kijuo emak; Kei kanajuotir ama khachu akadik kha eii, halli nangni'n ama kha jetmakchu. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Takkha kei'n ama kha kajet, ajarchu kei ama diangnga inphut kajuo, khat-um ama'n kei anajuotir.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Khawa jarra inmani'n ama kha sursik inleitho, takkha tuteii inkhat innum ama chungnga kut leimachulmu, ajarchu ama phakha laheitungmak. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Takkha mipui katamtak in amadiang inlei-ngamna-ah inleiti, “Messiah ajuokaal khan, hiwa mipa itho neek-ah ama'n inlak chuon kheella athosikbe?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Kasursik ah Raalmi ngai inleitir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Pharisee ngai'n Jisu jarra mipui'n chor inleitikha inleijet, khantia Thiampu kalianngai khat-um Pharisee ngai'n raalmi lekkhat ama kasursik-ah inleitir. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Jisu'n aleiti, “Kei nangni le aphakhat kalaomsik eii, halli kei kanajuotir amadiang kei'n kasisik eii. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Nangni'n kei ningna-entoksik eii, takkha nangni'n kei namunatun; kei kaom nakhan nangni'n sitheinutun.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Jihudi ngai'n inkhatli inkhatdiang inlei-inti, “Hunme ama'n sisik itho halli eini'n nimumaksik? Greek khuopui eini mi ngai omna khanbe ama'n asisik halli Greek mi-ngai diangbe ajuominchusik? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />‘Nangni'n kei ningna-entoksik eii, takkha nangni'n kei namunatun; kei kaom nakhan nangni'n sitheinutun’ tinahi ama'n ang atiname?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ringna kanapeii Tuiring</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Kahoi ahekna nikhuo, ahoinakhet nikhuoni, Jisu'n a-ngirra rasa inringnga aleiti, “Tu ka-ang mi khan atui raal inchu, keidiang heiwase inlang juo-inrase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Levi 23:36</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Keidiang inngamna mi kha, Pathian chong inthiang khan ileiti angnga, ‘Ringna tuiring ngai'n ama wonsuungnga inluongsik eii.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alam 37-38 ah Jisu chong ngaikha hintia malet cha: </char><char style="fqa">“Tu ka-ang in atui araal inchu kei diang heiwa inlang khat-um juo-inro. </char> <char style="fv">38 </char> <char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathian chong inthiang in iti angnga, ‘Ringna kanapeii tuiring ngai'n ama diang ka-inngamna tak miring suungnga aluongsik eii,’ ”</char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Ezek 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zech 14:8</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Jisu'n hiwahi, amadiang ka-ngamna ngai'n inchangsik Ratha jarra iril eii; khawa phakhan Ratha kha laleipemak, ajarchu Jisu kha lalur lalianmak.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mipui karra Inlei-inkhoithen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Inmani'n hiwa chong ngaihi inleijet phakhan, miring lekkhat in inleiti, “Hiwa mipa hi inthiangnga Pathian Chongkachoi eii!” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathian Chongkachoi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enru 1:21.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Leiilak ngai'n inleiti, “Amahi Messiah kha eii!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Takkha lekkhat ngai'n inleiti, “Messiah Galilee makheiya injir niabe?<verse eid="JHN 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Pathian chong inthiang khan Messiah kha David sapa esik eii khat-um David leiomna khuo Bethlehem makheiya heiwasik eii iti emak abe?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mic 5:2</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Khawa jarra mipui ngai karra ama jarra inlei-inkhoithen. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Mi lekkhat inchu ama kha inleisurzoot, takkha tuteii inkhat innum ama chungnga kut leimachulmu.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jihudi Thomatorna Ranak kanei ngai'n Lei-ngamnamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Raalmi ngaikhan inheikir phakhan, Thiampu kalian khat-um Pharisee ngai'n “Angjarra nangni'n ama ning-iheiruoi makme?” tia inleirakel.<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Raalmi ngai'n inleimasang, “Hiwa mipa iril angnga tuteii-um hinthoa karil laommu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Pharisee ngai'n inmanidiang inleirakel, “Ama'n nangni-um lamleiitiang nakeiruoi bejei?” <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />“Waikaroon ngai emakli Pharisee ngai'n amadiang ka-ngamna in-ommabejei? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Takkha Sinadan kajetmak mi ngai khachu khomaak inmukha ejei.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Jisu diang matiangnga kaleiluutjei, inmani karra inkhat ka-eii Nicodemus in inmani diang aleiti, <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Eini sinadan dungjuiya miring khat chungnga ama'n angme ileitho emakli amadiang ra-ngailekleiya chong tan cha-abe?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Inmani'n inleimasang, “Nang-um Galilee makheiya na-ebe? Pathian chong inthiang kha entokro halli nang in jetnate khachu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:52. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathian chongkachoi injirmu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript inkhat in hinti </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathian chongkachoi hongsuok nunu.</char></note>Galilee makheiya Pathian chongkachoi injirmu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Khale inruoiya inmani'n in-inn in-inntiang inkirjei.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Zool-inthai Numeisa inkhat Surna</para>
  <para style="p">[ <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Takkha Jisu chu Olive chingbung khan aleisi. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Halli ziingtiang ma-ah ama'n Biak-inn khan aheiwanook; mipui ngai'n amadiang inheiwa, halli ama'n alei in-ongnga inmani ngaikha aleiminchu. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Dan Ocha ngai khat-um Pharisee ngai'n zool-inthai numeisa inkhat insurra inheiruoi, halli mipui karra inlei min-ngirra <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />inmani'n Jisu diang inleiti, “Karu, hiwa numeisanu hi zool-inthai chuon inleitho laitak inhongsur eii.<verse eid="JHN 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Dan dungjuiya Moses in chongpeii aleida khachu hiwa ka-ang numeisa khachu lungnga deengthat ru. Nangleii hiwa jarra ang natime?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Levi 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Innidan 22:22-24</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Inmani'n hiwahi Jisu surna sik-ah inleiti eii, tichu inmani'n amadiang noonkung penasik eii. Takkha Jisu'n aleikuunna neipilla akut challa aleimajia. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Halli Inmani'n amadiang inlet-ah inleirakel jarra, ama'n alu hongtangnga inmanidiang aleiti, “Nangni karra manu kalathomak miring khan numeisanu diang mansakhet-ah lungnga deengrase.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Halli ama'n woikhat akuun rit-ah neipilla aleimajiarit. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Takkha inmani'n inlei rangai phakhan, upakhet makheiya inphut-ah, inmani rakip in inkhat inkhat-ah insiwiakjei, halli numeisanu khabit Jisu maikuungnga a-ngirra aleiom. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Jisu'n ahong-enna numeisanu diang aleiti, “Numeisa, inmani ngai huntiang insiwiak mejei? tuteii inkhat innum nangkha naminse mubejei?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Numeisanu'n aleiti, “Tuteii um ommujei, Pumi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Halli Jisu'n aleiti, “Kei innum nang naminse mongjei; sitro, woikhat inlet-ah manu thoritkhai maro.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript katamtak khat-um tiallaiya inleimalet khan hiwa mun hi inchenmak (8:1-11); lekkhat in Jn. 12:24 nuk-ah inchen; lekkhat in Luk 21:38 nuk-ah inchen; manuscript inkhat in Jn. 7:36 nuk-ah inchen.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Manmasituolla War kha eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Jisu'n Pharisee ngaidiang inlet-ah aleirilrit-ah aleiti, “Kei manmasituol war kha ka-eii; kei kanajui miring khan akaziing khan sikhai nunijei, takkha ringna war kha amusik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Matt 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Jn 9:5</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Pharisee ngai'n amadiang inleiti, “Nang napumtak jarra sakhi napeii; nang sakhi kha dikmak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Jn 5:31</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n kapumtak jarra sakhi kape innum, kei sakhi hichu adik, ajarchu kei humakheiya kijuome halli kei'n hunme kisi kei'n kajet. Takkha nangni inchu kei humakheiya kijuome emakli hunme kisi jetmakchu. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nangnichu taksa lamma chong ningtan; keichu tuteii diang-um chong tanmong. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Kei'n chong katan ngai suok-innum, kei chongtanchu adik, ajarchu kei katheinuo ah emong, takkha kei kanajuotir Kapa le kin eii. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Nangni Sinadan khan injiajei khachu miring inni sakhi kha adik.<verse eid="JHN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Kei kapumtak jarra sakhi kapeii, halli kei kanajuotir Kapa'n kei jarra sakhi eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Innidan 19:15</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Inmani'n amadiang inleiti “Nang napa hun omme?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Jisu'n aleimasang, “Nangni'n kei khat-um kei Kapa jetmakchu; nangni'n kei ningnaleijet inchu, nangni'n kei Kapa um ningleijetsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Hiwa chong ngaihi Biak-inn suungnga sialsum mintiingna munkhan Jisu'n aminchu pumma aleiril; takkha tuteii inkhat innum ama kha leisurmu, ajarchu ama phakha laheitungmak.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kei Kasinasik khan nangni Sitheinutun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Jisu'n inlet-ah inmani diang aleiti, “Kei kalasisik eii; nangni'n kei ningna-entoksik eii, halli ningmanu roonkhan nangni ningthisik eii; kei kasinasik khan nangni'n sitheinutun.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Khawa jarra Jihudi ngai'n inleiti, “Kei kasinasik khan nangni'n sitheinutun itihi Ma atheinuo-ah thisik itibe?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Nangnichu nuoi makheiya ning eii, Keichu chungtiang makheiya ka eii; nangnichu hiwa manmasituol makheiya ning eii, takkha keichu hiwa manmasituol makheiya emong. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Kei'n nangnidiang katijei, khachu nangni ningmanu roonkhan ningthisik eii, nangni'n ‘KEIHI KEI KA-EII’ tia ningna-ngamnamak laiseng nangni ningmanu roonkhan ningthisik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Inmani'n amadiang inleiti, “Nang tu na-eme?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n inphutna makheiya kileiti kha ejei. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:25. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kei'n inphutna makheiya kileiti kha ejei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ang jarra kei in nangni diang karil sik me?</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Kei'n nangni jarra tamthei karilsik khat-um tamthei chong katansik om; takkha Kei kanajuotir ama kha akadik kha eii, halli kei'n amadiang makheiya kijet kha kei'n manmasituol diang karilsouk.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Jisu'n Apa jarra inmani diang iril eii tikha inmani ngai'n leijetmu. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Khawa jarra Jisu'n aleiti, “Nangni'n Miring Sapa kha ningkadomsaang phakhan, nangni'n KEIHI KEI KA-EII tikha nangni'n jetningte, khachu kei kapumtak kamatorna ranak-ah iteii thomong takkha Kapa'n keidiang rilro iti ngaikhabit karil. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Halli kei kanajuotir ama kha keile omsuom; ama'n katheinuo ah nadamak, ajarchu ama lungdou kha kei'n amun rakip-ah katho.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Jisu'n arilla ompumma mikatam tak-in amadiang inlei-ngamna.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akadik khan Nangni Anamasuosik eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Jisu'n amadiang inngamnajei Jihudi ngaidiang aleiti, “Kei kachong ngaikha ningjuichei inchu, nangni inthiangnga kei siamruoi ning eii, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />halli nangni'n akadik kha jetningte, halli akadik khan nangni anamasuosik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Inmani'n amadiang inleimasang, “Keini Abraham tu-suonngai kin eii, halli keini'n tuteii diang-um suok lahong inchangmung. Angjarra nang in, ‘Nangni anamasuosik eii’ nitime?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Matt 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luk 3:8</ref> </char><verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kati, manu katho mi rakip manu suok in-eii. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Suok khan kumsoot-ah insuungkhur mi emak; asapa kha kumsoot-ah insuungkhur mi eii. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Asapa khan nangni anamasuojei inchu, nangni inthiangnga inamasuo kha esijei. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Kei'n kajet nangni Abraham tu-suonngai ning eii; takkha nangni'n kei nathatnasik ningjong, ajarchu ningmalungnga kei kachong reiinasik ommak. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Kapa in naminmu kha kei'n karil, halli nangnichu ningpa ngai naleiti kha nangni'n ningtho.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Inmani'n amadiang inleimasang, “Abraham keini kinpa eii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Nangni Abraham sangai ning-e inchu, Abraham ileitho ngaikha nangni'n ningthosik eii,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:39. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nangni Abraham sangai ning-e inchu, Abraham ileitho ngaikha nangni'n ningthosik eii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat in hin tia injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nangni ning eii inchu ... thoru.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Pathian diangnga akadik kajet-ah akaril keihi nangni'n thatsik ningjong. Takkha Abraham chu hiwa ka-ang iteii leithomak! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ningpa ngaitak ileitho ngaikha nangni'n ningtho eii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Inmani'n amadiang inleiti, “Keini bojai sa emung; keini kinpa inkhat om, khachu Pathian eii.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Pathian kha inthiangnga ningpa e-inchu, nangni'n kei ningnaminriang sik eii, ajarchu kei Pathian diang makheiya kijuo eii khat-um tuunhin kaom. Kei kalungdouwa kijuo emak; takkha ama'n innajuotir kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Angtia nangni'n kei itihi ningjetmak me? ajarchu nangni'n kei kachong ning ra-ngaimak jarra eii. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Nangnichu ningpa Seitan makheiya ning eii, khat-um ningpa imanuom kha nangni-um ningthozoot. Inphutna makheiya ama chu mi kathat eii khat-um akadik khan supngir ngirmak, ajarchu amadiang akadik kha ommak. Ma'n maleisei aril kaalkhan, a-ngaiya ama diangnga kaomkha iril eii, ajarchu maleiseipa eii khat-um maleisei rakipngai pa eii. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Takkha, Kei'n akadik karil jarra, nangni'n keidiang na-ngamna makchu. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Tume nangni karra keihi manu karoon eii kanati mator? Kei'n kadik kha karil-inle, angjarra nangni'n keidiang ngamna ningneimakme? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Pathian diang makheiya kajuo ama'n Pathian chongkha arangai; nangni'n ningra-ngai makna ajarchu nangni Pathian diang makheiya emak chuwa eii.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu khat-um Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Jihudi ngai'n amadiang inleimasang, “Nangchu Samaritan na-eii khat-um nang raikhuo kachoi na-eii kintihi dikmungbe?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei kapumma raikhuo ommak; kei'n Kapa khoya katho, takkha nangni'n kei khoya nathomakchu. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Kei kapumtak lurna lianna sik-ah entokmong; takkha aka-entok inkhat aom halli ama'n chongkatanpa esik eii. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kanati, tu miring inkhat in Kei kachong ajui inchu, ama kha angtikseng akathi mununi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Jihudi ngai'n amadiang inleiti, “Tuunchu keini'n inthiangnga kinjetjei khachu nang napumma raikhuo om! Abraham um Pathian chongkachoi ngai-um inthijei; halli nang in tu miring inkhat in Kei kachong ajui-inchu, akathi supmu mununi nati. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Akathijei kinpa Abraham neek-ah nang nalokwiai abe? halli Pathian chongkachoi ngai-um inthijei! Nangleii tu ka-eii na-intime?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei kapumtak kaminlur kaminlian inchu, kei lurna kha iteii emak; ning Pathian inchang Kapa tak-in naminlur naminlian eii. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Takkha Nangni'n ama kha lajetmakchu; keichu ama kha kajet. Kei'n ama kha jetmong kati-inchu, kei-um nangni angnga maleisei karil kha ka eii; takkha kei'n ama kha kajet khat-um ama chongkha kei'n kajui. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ningpa Abraham khan kei juonasik aphakha kamusik eii tia aleirok; halli ama'n aleimuwa aleirokjei.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Jihudi ngai'n amadiang inleiti, “Nang kumsoom ra-nga latungleiya nang in Abraham namuwabejei?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:57: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nang in Abraham namuwabejei? </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat in hin tia injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abraham hi nang namu bejei?</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kati, Abraham matiang Kei kalei-omjei.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Khawa jarra inmani'n amadiang deengna sik-ah lung inleiruut; takkha Jisu'n inthup-ah Biak-inn kha aleimathaan.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Amit cho-ah Innei Miring inkhat mindamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Jisu'n asiya aleiloon phakhan, ama'n injuonei makheiya amit kacho miring inkhat aleimu. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Asiamruoi ngai'n amadiang inleirakel, “Karu, tume manu katho, hiwa mipa hibe emakli anu apa ngai manu jarrabe ama'n amit cho-ah injuoneihi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Ama mit kachohi ama manu emakli anu apa manu jarra emak, takkha Pathian ranak kha ama chungnga chuon inlarnasik eii. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Kani omlaiseng kei kanajuotir ama chuonkha eini'n nithosik eii; tuteii innum chuon thothamak nasik zaan kha aheiwajei.<verse eid="JHN 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Kei'n manmasituolla kaomlaiseng, kei manmasituol war kha ka eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Matt 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jn 8:12</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Hiwa atisuo nuk-ah, Jisu'n neipilla aleimachil khat-um amachil kha rahut khale aleikamet halli dialdook kha miringpa mit-ah aleikanoot <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />halli amadiang aleiti, “Siro, halli Siloam (Siloam tinachu itir tina eii) tuikuong khan namai juophero.” Miringpa khan asiya amai ajuophe, halli amit amuwa ahongkir.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />A-indiang inwaipui khat-um matiang ama'n baksik ileini kaleimu mi-ngai'n inleiti, “Hiwa mipahi in-ong jolla baksik kanani kachak pakha emak abe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Mi lekkhat in inleiti, “Ama hi eii,” leiilaak ngai'n “Emak takkha amale inpuokeeng” inleiti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Ama'n aleiti, “Kei khawa mipa kha ka eii.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Inmani'n amadiang inleiti, “Ang omchanna nang in namit nihongmume?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ama'n aleimasang, “Jisu inti miring inkhat in dialdook aboolla, kamit-ah akanoot-ah anati, Siloamma siro halli namai juophero; Khawa jarra kei'n kasiya kamai kajuophe li kei'n kamit kamujei.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Inmani'n inleirakel, “Ama hun ommejei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">“Kei jetmong,” ama'n aleimasang.<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharisee ngai'n Imindam jarra Entokna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Inmani ngai'n amit kaleicho miring pakha Pharisee ngaidiang inleiruoi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Jisu'n dialdook boolla khat-um amit kachopa aleimindamna kha Sabbath nikhuoni alei eii. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Pharisee ngai'n, woikhat inlet-ah mipadiang angtho tholia namit nihongmume tia inleirakelnook. Ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Ama'n dialdook kamit-ah akanoot; kei'n kamai kajuophe, halli kei'n kamujei.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Pharisee lekkhat ngai'n inleiti, “Hiwa katho miring kha Pathian diang makheiya emak, ajarchu ama'n Sabbath kha juimak.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Takkha leiilaak ngai'n inleiti, “Angtho tholia manu karoon miring inkhat in hiwa ka-ang inlak chuon thomator niyabe?” inmani ngaiseng karra inlei-inkhoithen.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Khawa jarra Pharisee ngai'n mitkacho padiang woikhat inlet-ah inleirakelrit, “Nangleii amahi tu-eii natime? tichu ama'n nang namit naminmujei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Ama'n aleiti, “Amahi Pathian chongkachoi inkhat eii.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Jihudi ngai'n anu apa inleikoimak laisengchu ama kha amit leicho khat-um tuun ihongmu ejei tihi lei-ngamnamu, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />khawa jarra inmani diang inleirakel, “Hiwahi nangni'n amit cho-ah kinjuonei eii ningti nangni sapa kha ebo? halle, angtho tholia ama'n tuunchu imume?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Anu li apa khan inleimasang, “Keini'n kinjet amahi keini sapa kha eii, khat-um amit cho-ah kinjuonei eii. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Takkha ang omchanna ama'n tuunchu imume khachu keini'n jetmung, khale inruoiya ama mit-hi tu miring imindamme keini'n jetmung. Amadiang rakelru; amahi naipang emakjei, ama apum tak-in rilrase.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Anu li apa'n Jihudi ngai inleichi jarra hiwahi inleiti, ajarchu Jihudi ngai inzootna aleiom, khachu Jisu hi Messiah eii kati miring kha Synagogue makheiya inpuutsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Khawa jarra anu li apa khan, “Amahi naipang emakjei, amadiang rakelru inleiti!”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Khawa jarra inmani'n amit kaleichopa kha woikhat inlet-ah inkoirit-ah amadiang inleiti, “Pathian kha minpaakro; keini'n miring pakha manu karoon mi eii tikha kinjet.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Ama'n aleimasang, “Ama kha manu karoon mibe emakbe, kei'n jetmong; kei'n inkhatchu kajet, Kei kamit aleicho, tuunchu kei kamujei.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Inmani'n amadiang inleirakel, “Ama'n nangdiang angme itho? angtho tholi ama'n namit kacho imindamme?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ama'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Kei'n nangnidiang katisuojei, halli nangni'n rangaimakchu. angjarra nangni'n inlet-ah ninglara-ngai zootme? Nangni-um ama siamruoi ngai ning-ezootbe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Inmani'n amadiang inranna inleiti, “Nangchu ama siamruoi na eii, takkha keinichu Moses siamruoi kin eii. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Pathian in Moses le ilei inbiak khachu keini'n kinjet, takkha hiwa miringpa jarrachu ama humakheiya kaheiwame eini'n iteii jetmakmi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Miring pa'n aleimasang, “Hiwahi angtuk-ah ngak kaomme, angjarra nangni'n amahi humakheiya ijuome ningjetmak, takkha ama'n kei kamit kacho hichu imindam. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Eini'n nijet Pathian in manu karoon miring ngaidiang ra-ngaimak, takkha amadiang chubei katho khat-um ama lungdou katho mi ngai diangchu, Pathian in arangai. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Manmasituol hong-injirra inphut tuteii miring inkhat innum amit cho-ah injuonei miring amit kaminmurit lajetmakmi. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Hiwa miring pahi Pathian diang makheiya kajuo emak inchu, ama'n iteii thomator nuni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Inmani'n amadiang inleimasang, “Nang manule inruoiya innajuonei, halli nang in keinidiang nanaminchu sikbe?” halli inmani'n ama kha Synagogue makheiya inleipuutjei.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ratha-ah Mit Kacho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Jisu'n ama kha inpuutjei tikha aleijet, halli Jisu'n ama kha alei-intongpuiya aleiti, “Nang Miring Sapa diang na-ngamnabo?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Ama'n aleimasang, “Karu, kei'n ama diang ka-ngam nasik-ah, ama kha tume natipiro!”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Nang in ama kha namujei, tuun nangdiang karilla kaom ama kha eii.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Ama'n aleiti, “Pumi, Kei ka-ngamnajei!” halli ama'n Jisu diang chubei aleitho.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Jisu'n aleiti, “Kamumak ngai'n inmunasik, halli akamu ngai'n inmit chonasik kei'n manmasituolla chongkatan kijuo kha eii.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Pharisee lekkhat ama koolla kaom ngai'n hiwa chonghi injet-ah amadiang inleiti, “Keini ngai-um kinmit chobejei?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Nangni ningmit aleicho inchu, nangni'n manu karoon kha lei-enutun; takkha tuundet nangni'n keini kinmu ningti jarra, nangni manu karoon kha ningla-eii.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Keelngam Kakhaalpa khale Minkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kanati, keelngam omna innkot makheiya kaheiluutmak, takkha khattiang kalla kahongluut miring kha, inruup khat-um daku eii; <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />kot makheiya kaheiluut ama kha keelngamngai akakhaalpa kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Kot ka-ngaak pa'n ama sik-ah kot amalongpi; keelngam ngai'n ama rasa kha injet, halli ama'n ama keelngam ngaikha inramingnga akoiya tuoltiang akeiruoi. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ama'n ata-ngaiseng aheisuok puisuo phakhan, ama'n inmani ngai ma-ah asi, halli keelngam ngai'n ama nukkha injui, ajarchu inmani'n ama rasa kha injet. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Inmani'n mi leiilaak nukkha juinunu, takkha inmani'n ama diangnga inphut intaandelsik eii, ajarchu inmani'n ama rasa kha jetmu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Jisu'n inmani diang hiwa minkhinahi aleiti, takkha ama itikha inmani'n leijetmu.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Akatha Keelngam Kakhaalpa eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Khawa jarra Jisu'n woikhat inlet-ah inmani diang aleiti, “Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kanati, Kei keelngam ngaisik kot kha ka eii. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Kei matiangnga kaheiwa rakip ngaikha inruup khat-um daku in-eii; takkha keelngam ngai'n inmani diang leira-ngaimu. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Kei kot kha ka eii. Kei kadiang kaheiluut miring khan ringna amusik eii; ama'n aheiluut khat-um asuoksik eii halli sachik-um amusik eii. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Inruup khachu kamaruupsik, kathatsik, khat-um kaminmangsik bit-ah iheiwa kha eii; Keichu inmani'n ringna inmunasik khat-um insam omlekleiya ringna inmunasik-ah kijuo kha eii.”<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Kei akatha keelngam kakhaalpa kha ka eii. Akatha keelngam kakhaal pa'n keelngam ngaisik bit-ah aringkhuo apeii. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />In-iniak mi, keelngam kakhaalpa ka-emak khat-um keelngam ata ka-emak ama khanchu, malang iheiwa amuli, ama'n keelngam ngaikha adaduoiya ataandel; khawa jarra malang khan keelngam ngaikha asur khat-um inmani ngaikha apuut choomdar. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />In-iniak miring khan ataandel ajarchu keelngam ngaikha ama'n iteii minriangmak. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Kei akatha keelngam kakhaalpa kha ka eii; kei keelngam ngaikha kei'n kajet khat-um kei keelngam ngai'n kei innajet.<verse eid="JHN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Kapa khan kei inajet angnga kei innum Kapa kha kajet, halli kei keelngam ngaisik-ah kei'n karingkhuo kapeii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Matt 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10:22</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Hiwa keelngam inn hinna kaommak kei keelngam lekkhat inlaom; Kei'n inmani ngai-um kalaheiruoisik eii, inmani'n kei kachong injuisik eii, halli miring inkhatbit-in ikhaal keelngam rahooi in-esik eii.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">inmani'n kei kachong injuisik eii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat in hintho ah injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">omsik eii.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Hiwa jarra Kapa'n kei anaminriang, ajarchu kei'n woikhat inlet-ah leirit nasik-ah karingkhuo kapeii. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Tuteii inkhat innum karingkhuo keidiang makheiya leimu, takkha Kei kapum tak-in kipesuok kha eii. Kei'n kapesuok sik-ah ranak kanei, khat-um leikirnook nasik-ah ranak kanei; Hiwa hi-eii Kapa in keidiang thoro inati chongpeii.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Woikhat inlet-ah hiwa chongngai jarra Jihudi ngai karra rupniya inkhoithenjei. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Inmani katam tak-in inleiti, “Ama suungnga raikhuo om! amahi inweetjei; Ang sik-ah ama chongkha ningra-ngaime?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Leiilak ngai'n inleiti, “Raikhuo kaluut miring in hinthoa riltheinuni! raikhuo in amit kacho mi mindam mator-abe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jihudi ngai'n Jisu Leizootmu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Phalbi ahei-ephakhan, Biak-inn Minthiangna kahoi kha Jerusalemma inleitho. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Jisu'n Solomon Tuolngur inti Biak-inn khan asiya aleiom phakhan, <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Jihudi ngai'n ama kha inlei-uumma inleirakel, “Angchen kasoot nang in keinidiang inngam-samna nanapesik me? keinidiang inthiangnga tiro, nang Messiah kha na-ebe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n nangnidiang katisuojei, takkha nangni'n keidiang na-ngamna makchu. Kapa ramingnga ka-itho chuon ngaikhan, kei rathuulla sakhi in-eii; <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Takkha nangni'n ngamnamakchu, ajarchu nangni kei keelngam emakchu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Kei keelngam ngai'n karasa injet; kei'n inmani ngaikha kajet, halli inmani'n kei kanuk innajui. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Kei'n hektik kaboi ringna kha inmani diang kapeii, halli inmani'n supthi thinanujei, halli tuteii inkhat innum kei kakut makheiya inmani ngaikha nakasut theinunu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Inmani ngai keidiang kanapeii kei Kapa kha angrakip neek-ah alokwiai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kanapeii kei Kapa kha angrakip neek-ah alokwiai; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat in hin tia injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kei kapa, inmani kha kei kadiang kanapeii, ama kha alokwiai.</char></note> halli tuteii inkhat innum inmani ngaikha Kapa kut makheiya kasut theinunu. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Kapa li Kei inkhatbit kin eii.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Jihudi ngai'n inlet-ah amadiang deengna sik-ah lung inleiruut. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Kei'n Kapa diangnga inphut chuon katha katamtak nangnidiang kanaminmujei; angkachang jarrame nangni'n keidiang lungnga ningna deengsik?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Jihudi ngai'n inleimasang, “Keini'n chuon katha nathojarra lungnga kinnadeengsik emak, takkha Pathian narilthai jarra eii; ajarchu miring na-epumma Pathian ka-eii nati.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Levi 24:16</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Nangni sinadan khan hintia injiajei ‘Nangni pathian ngai ning eii.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Minpkla 82:6</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Pathian chong kajuotungjei inmani ngaidiang Pathian in pathian ngai tia akoi-inle (Pathian chong inthiang kha mangtheinuni), <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />‘Kei Pathian Sapa ka-eii kati jarra’ Apa'n aminthiangnga manmasituolla ijuotirjei amadiang nangni'n Pathian narilthai ninglatibe? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Kei'n Kapa chuon ngaikha kathomak inchu, nangni'n keidiang na-ngamnamaru. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Takkha kei'n chuon ngaikha katho inchu, nangni'n keidiang ningna ngamnamak innum, Kapa khan keidiang om halli Kei'n Kapa diang kaom tihi ningjetnasik chuon ngaikha ngamnaru.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Woikhat inlet-ah inmani'n ama kha surnasik inleijong, takkha inmani ngai kutchung makheiya asuok-ah aleisi.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Halli Jisu'n inlet-ah Jordan tuidung arakaanna John in mansakhet-ah baptize aleiminthona munkhan aleisi, halli khawa khan ama'n aleiom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 1:28">Jn 1:28</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Mipui katamtak amadiang inheiwa-ah inleiti, “John chu inlak chuon iteii leithomak, takkha John in hiwa mipa jarra ileiril rakip ngaikha adik.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Halli khawa khan mipui katamtak-in amadiang inlei-ngamna.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lazarus Thina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Bethany makheiya araming Lazarus inti miring inkhat ana-ah aleiom, Bethany hi Mary li Martha ngai unai omna khuo kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 10:38">Luk 10:38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:39">39</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Hiwa Mary hi eii, Pumi keiiya sariak rimkahoi bunna asamma akeii kaleinuulpi nukha, akanapa Lazarus hi anaipa kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jn 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:38">Luk 7:38</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mk 14:3</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Khawa jarra a-unu ngai'n Jisu diang chong inleipeii, “Pumi, nang iminriang pakha anajei.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Jisu'n chongkha aleijet phakhan, ma'n aleiti, “Hiwa akanahi akathi sik emak; Pathian lurna heichoinasik eii, halli hiwa hi'n Pathian Sapa kha lurna amusik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Jisu'n Martha li anainu khat-um Lazarus kha aleiminriang. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ama'n Lazarus kha anajei iti chongkha aleijet phakhan, Ama'n aleiomna munkhan nini alaleiom. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Halli hiwa thengnga ama'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Judea-ah woikhat siritrui.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Asiamruoi ngai'n amadiang inleiti, “Rabbi, Jihudi ngai'n nangkha apha matiang lungnga nadeengnasik inna-entok, halli nang in khawa khan woikhat nalasiritsibe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Suun khat-ah phadan soomleini emak abe? suunna chuonkatho mi khan insuinuni, ajarchu ama'n hiwa manmasituol war kha amu. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Takkha tu ka-ang inkhat in zaanna chuon atho inchu, ama'n insui, ajarchu war kha amadiang ommak.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Jisu'n hiwa itile inruoiya inmani diang aleiti, “Nisuopui Lazarus kha azaaljei, takkha kei ama kakeithei kasisik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Asiamruoi ngai'n amadiang inleiti, “Pumi, ama'n azaaljei inchu damjeite.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Jisu inchu Lazarus kathi jarra aril, takkha inmani inchu azaalla soong imachum jarra inlei-ngaidon. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Khawa jarra Jisu'n inmani diang inthiangnga aleirilpi, “Lazarus athijei; <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Nangni ngamnasik jarra kei'n khawa munkhan kileiommak kha karatha arok. Eini'n amadiang situi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Didymus Thomas in asappui siamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Amale juothi suomnasik eini rakip um situi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu hi Hongringritna khat-um Ringna kha eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Jisu'n aheitung phakhan, Lazarus kha thaanna inreiina nimili huuijei tikha aleijet. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bethany hi Jerusalem makheiya miles innidaam inlaak, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />halli Jihudi katamtak-um innaipa thipi jarra Mary li Martha kamatheemtai sik-ah inheiwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Martha in Jisu kha aheiwajei ti aleijet phakhan, ama'n aheisuok-ah Jisu kha alei-inmupui, takkha Mary chu innsuungnga aleiom. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Martha in Jisu diang aleiti, “Pumi, nang in hin naleiomngai suok-inchu, kanaipa hi leithinuni! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Takkha kei'n kajet khachu tuunnum nang in Pathian diang na-ini rakip kha Pathian in nangdiang napesik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Jisu'n Martha diang aleiti, “Nanaipa aringnook sik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Martha in aleimasang, “Ahekna nikhuoni khan ama kha hongringritte tikha kei'n kajet.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Jisu'n Martha diang aleiti, “Kei hongkaringnook khat-um ringna kha ka eii; Kei kadiang ka-ngamna miring khan inleithi innum inhongring sik eii, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />halli karingnga kei kadiang ka-ngamna miring khan angtikseng thinunijei. Nang hiwahi na-ngamnabo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Ama'n Jisu diang aleiti, “Oh, Pumi; Kei'n nanghi Messiah, Pathian Sapa manmasituolla akajuo kha na-eii tia ka-ngamna.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Chapna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Hiwahi atisuoli Martha in asiya anainu Mary diang ruuk-ah ajuoti, “Karu kha hin omjei halli ama'n nangkha anakoi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Hiwa chonghi ajet phakhan, Mary in innottheiya intheiya Jisu inmupui sik-ah aleisi. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Jisu kha khuosuung laheiluutmak, takkha Martha in intongpuina munkhan alaleiom. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Innsuungnga kaom Mary kamatheemtai Jihudi ngai'n Mary in innottheiya intheiya tuol isuok inmu phakhan, inmani'n Mary kha thaanna akachapsik isirit ejei inngaidonna anukkha inleijui.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mary in Jisu omnakhan aheitungnga ama'n Jisu kha amuli amumak ama kekuungnga inbok-ah aleiti, “Pumi, nang in hin naleiomngai suok-inchu kanaipa hi leithinuni!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Jisu'n Mary khat-um Mary le kaheiwasuom Jihudi ngai'n inchap kha aleimu phakhan, amalungnga kahoimak khat-um poongna aleinei. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Jisu'n aleirakel, “Ama kha hun ningreiime?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Inmani'n inleimasang, “Pumi, heiwa-inlang juo-enro.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Jisu'n aleichap. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Jihudi ngai'n inleiti, “Enru ama'n angtuk iminriangme!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Takkha miring lekkhat ngai'n inleiti, “Amit kacho kaminmu hiwa mipa hi'n Lazarus thimaknasik thomatormak niabe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lazarus Minringritna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Inlet-ah malung kahoimak in asip-ah, Jisu'n thaanna aleisi, thaankha lungkarong khurra alei-eii, khat-um thaankha lungnga inleikhar. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Jisu'n aleiti, “Lung kha khairu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Akathipa unu Martha in amadiang aleiti, “Pumi, tuuntak pha hinchu athurim aleisasik ejei, inreiina nimili hei-ejei!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Jisu'n Martha diang aleiti, “Na-ngamna inchu Pathian lurna lianna kha namusik eii natimongbe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Khawa jarra Inmani'n lungkha inleikhai. Halli Jisu'n chungtiang enna aleiti, “Kapa Kei'n nangkha kanaminpaak, ajarchu nang in keidiang nanara-ngaipi. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Nang in amunle apha rakip-ah keidiang nanazootpi itihi kei'n kajet, keihi nang inajuotir eii tia hinna kaom inmani ngai'n ngamna inneinasik kei'n inmani sik-ah nangdiang kanahongni.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ama'n hiwahi atisuoli, “Lazarus, heisuokro” tia rasa inringnga aleikoi. <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Lazarus khan akeii akut khat-um ameel ngaikha kathi puonna intuomma aheisuok. Jisu'n inmanidiang aleiti, “Suutpi inlang ama kha minsiru.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Surnasik-ah Palaak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matt 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mk 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luk 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Mary le akaheiwa Jihudi mi katamtak ngai'n Jisu itho inmu phakhan, inmani'n amadiang inlei-ngamnajei. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Takkha miring lekkhat chu Pharisee ngaidiang inkirra Jisu itho ngaikha inmani diang injuorilpi. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Khawa jarra Thiampu kalian khat-um Pharisee ngai'n uparup ngaikha inkhoomchunna inleiti, “Angkeme eini'n nithosik? ajarchu hiwa miringpa'n inlak chuon tamthei athojei! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Eini'n hin niminthotit inchu, mi rakip in amadiang ngamna inneisik ejei, halli Rome chuonkaroon ngai'n hong-inta eini inthiang Biak-inn khat-um niphung nizaat hi-um innakasutsik ejei!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Takkha inmani ngai karra, Caiaphas, khawa kumma Thiampu Kaliankhet ka-eii, ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni iteii jetmakchu! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Phungli zaat rakip kamangsik neek-ah mipui sik-ah miring inkhat akathisik hi athawiai itihi nangni'n jetmak chube?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Hiwahi ama'n apumtak ranak-ah iti emak; takkha khawa kumma Thiampu Kaliankhet ejarra Jisu hi Jihudi phungli zaat sik-ah athisik eii tia ama'n ileirilsuok kha eii, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />inmani sikbit emak, takkha inchekchaiya kaom Pathian mi ngaikha inkhat bit-ah aheikeichun nasik eii.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Khawa nikhuoni makheiya ranak kanei Jihudi ngai'n ama thatnasik-ah minsuukna inleinei. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Khawa jarra Jisu'n Jihudi ngai karra inlarra leisimakjei, takkha khawa ramkha amathaanna neelram koolla kaom Ephraim inti khuokhan aleisi, halli khawakhan ama'n asiamruoi ngaikhale aleiom.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Jihudi ngai Rakaanna Kahoi aheitungnasik aphakha aleinai, halli mipui katamtak in ram ram makheiya kahoi madet inmani sinadan dungjuiya inthiangnasik Jerusalemma inleisi. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Inmani'n Jisu kha inlei-entok, halli Biak-inna inngirra inkhatli inkhat in, “Ama kha kahoiya ahongsikbe, hongnunibe, nangleii ang na-ngaidonme?” tia inlei-inbiak. <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Thiampu kalian ngai khat-um Pharisee ngai'n Jisu omna kajet mi rakip in inmani diang ningnamindiksik eii, halli inmani'n Jisu kha kinsursik eii tia chongkha inleipejei.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Bethany ah Sariak Kanootna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matt 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mk 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Rakaanna Kahoi niruk matiang, Jisu'n akathi makheiya iminring Lazarus omna khuo Bethany ah aheiwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Khawa khan inmani'n ama sik-ah kholei bu inleiminsuuk, Martha in baksik kha aleiminsuuk halli Jisu le kabak sik-ah lei-in-ong karra Lazarus um alei-eii.<verse eid="JHN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mary in aman katam inthiang Nard-ah insum sariak arim kahoi aheichoiya Jisu keiikha ajuokanoot halli Jisu keiikha asamma aleinuul, halli inn pumpui kha sariakrim kahoikhan aleisip. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Takkha Judas Iscariot asiamruoi ngai karra Jisu kajuorsik pakhan aleiti, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Angjarra hiwa sariak hi dangka pum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5. </char><char style="fk" closed="false">dangka pum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">enru 6:7.</char></note> rajathumma nijuor li sara ngaidiang nipemakme?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ama'n hiwa atina jarchu sara ngaikha aminriang khat-um asanzoot jarra emak takkha ama chu inruup ejarra eii. Ama'n sialkok kha achoi halli sialkok-ah inthun sialkha ama'n aleikeiduuk.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Jisu'n aleiti, “Numeisanu in alungdou kha thorase, halli ama'n ineikha kei inreiina nikhuo sik-ah darase.<verse eid="JHN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Sara ngai khachu amunle apha rakip-ah nangnile inomsuom, takkha keichu omsuom numin.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Innidan 15:11</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lazarus Thatnasik-ah Palaak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Jihudi mikatam tak-in Jisu kha Bethany ah aom tihi inleijet pha khan, Jisu jarra bit emak-ah takkha ama'n akathi makheiya iminringjei Lazarus ka-ensik um inmani'n inheiwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Halli Thiampu kalian ngai'n Lazarus um thatnasik-ah inlei-insuuk. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Ajarchu ama jarra Jihudi mi katamtak-in inmani makheiya insuok-ah halli Jisu diang inlei-ngamna.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mai Ka-ar tak-ah Jerusalemma Luutna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matt 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ziingkhuo warli Rakaanna Kahoi sik-ah akahongjei mipui katamtak ngai'n Jisu Jerusalemma aheiwasik eii tikha inleijet.<verse eid="JHN 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Khawa jarra inmani'n kanoubuo inchoiya “Hosanna! Pumi ramingnga akajuo ama kha rawaan katha eii! Israel ngai Reng kha rawaan atha” intia inkheek-ah ama inmupui sik-ah inleisi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Minpkla 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Jisu'n salungdai amuwa aleichuong; Chong-inthiang in iti angnga,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Chimaru, Zion sa-ngai!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Enru, nangni rengpa kha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">salungdai teii achuongnga aheiwajei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zech 9:9</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Ama siamruoi ngai'n hiwahi leijetmu; takkha Jisu'n ahongringsuo thengngachu, inmani'n hiwa ngaihi ama jarra injia khat-um amadiang akasuok kha ejei tia inlei-ngaidon.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Lazarus kha thaan makheiya akoisuok-ah akathi makheiya iminring kamu Jisu le inruoi mipui ngai'n mi leiilaak ngaidiang sakhi inleipeii. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Mipui ngai'n ama inmupui inheiwana ajarchu ama'n hiwa inlakchuon ileithohi inleijet jarra eii. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Pharisee ngai'n inkhatli inkhat diang inlei-inti, “Ningmubo, nangni iteii thomator makchu! Enru, manmasituol pumpui'n ama nukkha injuijei!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Greek Mi lekkhat in Jisu Inlei-entok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kahoi suungnga Jerusalemma chubei kathosik-ah aleikasi ngai karra Greek Mi lekkhat inlei-inchel. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Inmani'n Galilee ah Bethsaida inti makheiya Philip diang inleisiya inleiti, “Ocha, keini'n Jisu kin-inmupuizoot.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Philip in asiya Andrew diang aleiti, halli inmani inni in insiya Jisu diang inleiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Miring Sapa alurnasik tuun aphakha aheitungjei. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kanati, sahuum khan neipilla achulla khat-um athimak inchu, inkhatbit eya aomchei, takkha sahuum khan athi inchu, akara katamtak ahongkara.<verse eid="JHN 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Ama ringkhuo kaminriang miring khan aringkhuo aminmangsik eii; halli hiwa manmasituolla aringkhuo kaminriangmak miring khan hektik kaboi ringna sik-ah aringkhuo kha areiiya ada. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Matt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Kei sepa katho miring khan, kei kanuk anajuisik eii, halli kei kaomna khan, kei kasuok kha-um aomsik eii, Kei sepa katho miring kha Kapa in khoya athosik eii.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Athinasik jarra Iril</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Tuun kei kamalung apoongjei, halli angme kei'n katisik? ‘Kapa, hiwa pha makheiya kei nasanro katisik be’? tinuning, hiwa sikbit jarra kei'n kijuo kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Kapa, naraming kha lurrase!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Halli marwaanna inphut rasa khat ajuonei, “Kei'n kaminlurjei, halli kei'n inlet-ah kaminlurritsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Khawa khanna kangirra kaom mipui ngai'n rasa kha inleijet-ah inleiti, ro-inri rasa eii, aleiilaak ngai'n inleiti, “Marwaan Tirton inkhatle ama inbiak eii!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Takkha Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Rasa kha Kei sik-ah kajuo emak, takkha nangni sik-ah eii. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Tuun hiwa manmasituol sik-ah chongtan napha kha ejei; hiwa manmasituol karoonpa kha tuun inpuutsik ejei. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Kei nuoipil chungnga innakadom minsaangniya inphut, mi rakip keidiang kakeiruoisik eii.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Hiwa atinachu ama'n ang omchanna athisikme ti inaminjet kha eii.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Mipui ngai'n inleimasang, “Keini'n Sinadan makheiya kinjetjei tichu Messiah kha kumsoot aringsik eii. Angjarra, halle, nang in Miring Sapa kha inkadom saangsik eii nitime? Hiwa Miring Sapa hi tume?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Minpkla 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Ezek 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Apha lekkhat War kha nangnile omte. War kha omlai nangni'n chuon thoru, akaziing khan nangni anamator maklai; akaziingnga kaom miring khan hunme isi tikha jetmak. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />War kha nangnidiang omlai, khat-um War sangai ning-eii nasik, War kha ngamnaru.”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Jihudi ngai'n Lei-ngamnamu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Jisu'n hiwa atisuo thengnga, Ama'n asuok-ah inmani diangnga inphut alei-inthup. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ama'n inmani ngai maikuungnga inlak chuon tamthei athojei innum, inmani'n amadiang lei-ngamnamu<verse eid="JHN 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />ajarchu Pathian chongkachoipa Isaiah ileitikha huui tungnasik eii: <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Pumi, eini chongkha tu-in ngamna mejei?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">halli Pumi ranak kha tudiang amalarmejei?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Khawa jarra inmani'n ngamnanunu, ajarchu Isaiah in inlet-ah aleiti,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Pathian in inmani ngai mitkha amincho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">khat-um inmalung kha amin-ngarpi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">tichu inmani'n inmumak nasik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">halli inmalungnga injetmak nasik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">khat-um keidiang inhei inletsik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">halli kei'n inmani kamindamsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaiah in hiwahi aleiti ajarchu Jisu lurna kha aleimu khat-um ama jarra aleiril.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Khale inruoiya, chuonkaroon Jihudi katamtak um Jisu diang inlei-ngamna; takkha Pharisee ngai'n Synagogue makheiya innapuutsik eii tia inleichi jarra inmani'n lei-inlarmu. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Ajarchu inmani'n Pathian in iminpaak neek-ah miring ngai'n inminpaak kha inleimanuom.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Chong in Chongtan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Jisu'n inringnga aleiti, “Kei kadiang ka-ngamna miring khan kei ina-ngamna emak takkha kei kanajuotir ama kha i-ngamna eii. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Halli Kei kanamu miring khan kei kanajuotir ama kha imu ejei. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Kei kana-ngamna miring rakip in akaziing khan inom-maknasik kei'n manmasituolla War ka-inchangnga kajuojei. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Kei iti chongngai kajet halli akajuimak mi ngaikha, Kei'n inmani diang chong tannuning, ajarchu Kei manmasituol diang chongkatan kijuo kha emak takkha kakatan sik-ah kijuo kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Kei kanazootmak khat-um kei iti chongngai kaleimak mi ngai sik-ah chong katansik inkhat om. Kei ileirilsuok chongngai khan inmani chungnga ahekna nikhuoni khan chong atansik eii! <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ajarchu kei kapumtak thomatorna karanak-ah kiril kha emak, takkha kei kanajuotir Kapa'n katisik khat-um karilsik chongpeii ngaikha ama'n keidiang anatipi. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Kei'n kajet khachu ama chongpeii kha kumsoot ringna eii. Kei iril hi, Kapa'n keidiang tiro iti chong ngaikha eii.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Asiamruoi ngai Keii arasupi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Rakaanna Kahoi aheitung madet, Jisu'n hiwa manmasituol amathaanna Apa koolla akirnasik ama phakha heitungjei ti aleijet phakhan, manmasituolla kaom ama mi takngaikha aleiminriang, halli ama'n inmani ngaikha ahekna katung aminriang.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Halli kholeibu inbakpha khan, Seitan khan Simon sapa Judas Iscariot malung suungnga Jisu juornasik-ah aleipesuo phakhan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seitan khan ... Jisu juornasik; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Seitan khan angaidon suojei khachu Simon sapa Judas Iscariot in Jisu kha ajuorsik eii.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Jisu'n ama kutchungnga ranak rakip kha Apa'n apejei halli amahi Pathian diang makheiya ijuo eii khat-um Pathian diang akirnook sik eii tihi aleijet-ah, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />ama'n bubakna khamtuol makheiya intheiya, chungtiang ikahak asongkol kha aliik-ah, halli akhoongnga koongkhit kha aleikhit. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Halli rasuna beella tui abunna asiamruoi ngai keii karasu aleiphut khat-um akoongkhit puon khan inmani ngaikha aleinuul. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ama'n Simon Peter diang aheiwa, halli Peter in amadiang aleiti, “Pumi, nang in kei kakeii-um narasusibe?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Kei'n angme kitho nang in tuun jetnutin, takkha nang in nuktiang nahongjetsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Peter in aleimasang, “Nang in kei kakeii angtikseng rasuthei nutin!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n nang nakeii karasumak inchu, nangle kei inchunmakmi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simon Peter in aleimasang, “Pumi, kakeiibit emak takkha kakut li kalu um narasu piro!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Tuikabuol suojei miring khan akeiibit rasusik arei eii,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat ah </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akeiibit </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tihi inchenmak.</char></note> apum raya-ah inthiangjei, halli nang-um nanthiangjei, takkha nangni ningraya achu ning-inthiang emak.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Ajarchu Jisu'n tume ama kajuorsik tikha aleijet suojei, khawa jarra ama'n aleiti, “Nangni ningraya achu ning-inthiang emak.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Jisu'n inmani keii arasupi suoli, ama'n apuondiar inlukrit-ah halli khamtuolla in-ongnga ama'n inmani diang aleirakel, “Kei'n nangnidiang ka-itho kha nangni'n ningjetbo?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luk 22:27</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />“Nangni'n Karu khat-um Pumi tia ningnakoi, halli nangni itikha adik, ajarchu khawakha Kei ka eii. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Ning Karu khat-um ning Pumi Kei'n ningkeii karasujei keengnga, nangni-um inkhatli inkhat ningkeii ning insusik eii. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Kei'n nangnidiang kileitho angnga nangni innum ningthona sik-ah Kei'n ningjetnasik kinaleipe kha ejei.<verse eid="JHN 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang karil: suok khan ama karu neek-ah lokmak; emakli injuotir ama khan akajuotirpa neek-ah lokmak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Matt 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Jn 15:20</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Hiwa ngaihi ningjetli, ningtho inchu rawaan katha kha ning eii.”<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Kei'n nangni ningraya jarra kiril emak; Kei ikadang ngaikha kei'n kajet; takkha ‘Kei waipool kabak ama'n kei kachungnga akeii ada’ iti Pathian chongkha huui tungnasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Minpkla 41:9</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Kei'n hiwahi tuun asuokmaklai nangnidiang kinati kha eii, tichu ahongsuok kaalkhan nangni'n ‘KEIHI KEI KA-EII’ tikha ningngamna sik eii.<verse eid="JHN 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Kei'n inthiangnga nangnidiang kanati, Kei itir mi inkhattak karalaang miring khan Kei inaralaang eii; halli Kei kanaralaang miring khan kei kanajuotir ama kha aralaang.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Matt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Ama Kajuorsik jarra Matiang aleirilsuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matt 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mk 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Jisu'n hiwa atisuo thengnga, ama'n amalungnga apoongnga aleirilsuok, “Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanati; nangni karra miring inkhat in kei anajuorsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Asiamruoi ngai'n khatli inkhat inlei-in-en, takkha tu jarra irilme tikha leijetmu. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Asiamruoi ngai karra miring inkhat Jisu'n iminriang pakha Jisu diang inngaiya alei-in-ong. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simon Peter in ama diang abiak chianna aleiti, “Tu jarra ama'n irilme rakelro.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Khawa Siamruoi khan Jisu diang inngaiya halli “Pumi, tume?” tia aleirakel.<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n waipool lekkhat ankheengnga kanoomli kipeii, ama kha eii.” Halli ama'n waipool lekkhat aleiya ankheengnga aleinoom, khat-um Simon Iscariot sapa Judas diang aleipeii. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Judas in waipool kha aleili aleimak, Seitan khan amadiang aleiluut. Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Nathosik chuonkha innottheiya thotro!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Bubakna khamtuol khan in-ongnga kaom tuteii inkhat innum angjarra Jisu'n hiwahi amadiang itime tikha leijetmu. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Siamruoi lekkhat ngai'n Judas kha sialpu eyarra Jisu'n kahoi suungnga inbak sik-ah bakphur karacho emakli sara ngaidiang sial kapeii iminsi lei-ete tia inlei-ngaidon.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Judas in waipool kha aleisuoli aleisuomak, ama'n innottheiya asuok-ah aleisi, khawa phakha zaanchim alei-eii.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akathar Chongpeii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Judas in asisuo thengnga, Jisu'n aleiti, “Tuun Miring Sapa kha alurjei; halli ama diangnga inphut Pathian kha-um alurjei. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Pathian in ama diangnga inphut alur-inchu, Pathian innum ama kha apum tak-ah aminlursik eii, khat-um tuuntak aminlursik eii.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Minriang kaom naipang ngai, apha bongkhat kei nangnile kaom suomsik eii. Nangni'n kei ningna-entoksik eii, Jihudi ngaidiang kileiril chongkha tuun nangnidiang kiril kha eii, ‘Kei kasinasik khan nangni hongthei nutun.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Jn 7:34</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Kei'n nangnidiang akathar chongpeii kanapeii, khachu inkhatli inkhat inriangru; Kei'n nangni kinaminriang angnga, nangni-um khatli inkhat ning-inriangsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Jn 15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Jn 5</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Nangni khatli inkhat ning-inriangjei inchu, khawakhan manmasituol pumpui'n nangni ngaihi kei kasiamruoi ning-eii tikha jet inte.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Peter Maleisei rilsik leirilsuok masana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matt 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simon Peter in amadiang aleiti, “Pumi, hunme nasisik?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei kasinasik khan nang in tuun najuithei nutin, takkha nuk-ah nang in nanahongjuisik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Peter in aleimasang, “Pumi, angjarra kei'n tuun nang kanajui theimak sikme? Kei nangsik bit-ah karingkhuo pekate.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Keisik bit-ah nang thimator tinnabe? Kei'n inthiangnga nangdiang kanati, nang in keikha woithum najetmong natimak laiseng, arkhong khan khuongnuni.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Pa Pathian diang Sinasik Lam kha eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Nangni ningmalung kapoong emaru; Pathian<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngamnaru; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nangni ngamnaru.</char></note> ngamnaru, halli kei-um na-ngamnaru. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Kei Kapa inna omna mun katamtak aom; aleiom makngai suok-inchu, kei'n nangnidiang nangni omnasik mun kabool kisi eii timak ningngabe? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Halli kei'n nangni omnasik mun kasiya kabool suoli, kei'n juorit kata nangni-um kakoolla kanaruoisik eii, ajarchu kei omnakhan nangni-um ningomsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Halli kei hunme kisi, nangni'n lamkha ningjet.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Thomas in amadiang aleiti, “Pumi, hunme nisi keini'n jetmung; angtho tholi keini'n lam kha kinjetsikme?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Kei lam kha ka-eii, akadik kha ka-eii, khat-um ringna kha ka-eii; kei diangnga inphut elekleiya tuteii miring innum Kapa diang tungnunu. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Nangni'n kei ningnaleijet inchu, nangni'n kei Kapa kha-um ningleijetsik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:7. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nangni'n kei ningnaleijet inchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ningleijetsik kha eii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat ah hin tia injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nangni'n kei ningnaleijetjei inchu ... nangni'n jetningte.</char></note> kha eii; tuun makheiya chu nangni'n ama kha ningjetjei khat-um ningmujei.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Philip in amadiang aleiti, “Pumi, Pa Pathian kha keinidiang naminmuro, halli keini'n kinmalung ataisik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n apha kasoottak nangnile kaom; kha e-innum nangni'n kei nalajet makchube, Philip? Kei kanamu miring khan Apa Pathian kha-um imukha ejei. Angjarra, halle, nang in Pa Pathian nangnidiang naminmuro nitime? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Kei'n Kapa diang kaom halli Kapa in keidiang om tihi nang ngamna makchebe? Kei'n nangnidiang kiril chong ngaihi kei kapumtak thomatorna ranak-ah kiril kha emak; takkha kei kadiang kaom Pa Pathian in ama chuon ngaikha itho eii.” <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Keidiang na-ngamnaru khachu Kei'n Kapa diang kaom halli Kapa in keidiang om, kha emakli ka-itho chuon ngai'n ajar-eya ngamnaru. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanati, Kei kadiang kangamna mi khan kei itho chuon ngaikha athosik eii, hiwa chuonngai neek-ah kalokwiai ama'n alahongthosik eii, ajarchu kei'n Kapa diang kasisik eii. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Pa Pathian in Asapa diangnga inphut lurna lianna amunasik-ah kei karamingnga ning-ini rakip, kei'n kathosik eii. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Nangni'n kei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat achu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">itihi inchenmak.</char></note> karamingnga angmo khattak ningnani inchu, Kei'n kathosik eii.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Ratha Inthiang Penasik-ah Chong-inkhit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Nangni'n kei ningnaminriang inchu, nangni'n kei chongpeii ngaikha juiningte. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Kei'n Pa Pathian diang kanisik eii, halli ama'n kei ka-emak Akanasansik nangnile kumsoot kaomsik inkhat anapesik eii, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />khawakha Ratha Inthiang kha eii. Manmasituol in ama kha ralaangnuni, ajarchu manmasituol in ama kha jetmak khat-um mumak; takkha nangni'n ama kha ningjet, ajarchu ama'n ningsuungnga om khat-um nangnile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:17. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">om; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat inchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aom sik eii.</char></note> omsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Kei'n nangni kha nu le pa kaboi angnga nadanuning; Kei'n nangnidiang kajuoritsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Apha sootlekleiya, manmasituol in kei hi namununijei, takkha nangni inchu kei ningnamusik eii; kei karing jarra, nangni-um ningringsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Khawa nikhuo nikhan kei'n Kapa diang kaom, nangni'n kei kadiang ning-om, halli kei'n nangnidiang kaom tihi nangni'n ningjetsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Kei chongpeii ngai kakeiluut khat-um akajui mi ngaikha eii kei kanaminriang, kei kanaminriang mi ngaikha Kapa'n aminriangsik eii; Kei innum inmani ngaikha kaminriangsik eii halli kapumtak inmani diang ka-inlarsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Judas (Judas Iscariot ka-emak) in amadiang aleiti, “Pumi, angjarra nang in manmasituol diang inlarlekleiya keinidiang na-inlarsik me?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Miring inkhat in kei anaminriang inchu, ama'n kei kachong kha ajuisik eii, halli Kapa in ama kha aminriangsik eii, halli keini'n amadiang juokinta amale kin-omsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Kei kanaminriangmak ama khan kei kachong ngaikha juimak, halli nangni'n ningrangai chongkha kei kachong emak takkha kei kanajuotir Kapa chong kha eii.”<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Hiwa ngaihi kei'n nangnile kaomlai nangnidiang kileiril kha ejei. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Takkha Kanasanpa, Ratha Inthiang kha, Kapa'n kei karamingnga ajuotirsik eii, ama'n angrakip kha anaminchusik eii, halli kei'n nangnidiang kileiril rakip ngaikha ngaidon matorna anapesik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Akahoi akadai kha nangnidiang omrase; kei diangnga kaom akahoi akadai kha nangnidiang kanapeii, manmasituol inapeii angnga kei'n napemong. Ningmalungnga akapoong, khat-um akachi kha emarase. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Kei'n nangnidiang kiti kha nangni'n ningjet, ‘Kei'n kasisik eii, halli kei'n nangnidiang kajuoritsik eii.’ Nangni'n kei ningnaminriang inchu, nangni'n ningroksik eii, ajarchu kei Kapa diang kisi eii; ajarchu Kapa kha keineek-ah alok. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Ajarchu ahongsuokli nangni'n ningngamna sik-ah, tuun apha ahongtung maklai kei'n nangnidiang kileiti kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Kei nangnile kasoot-ah inkook nuningjei, ajarchu hiwa manmasituol waikaroonpa kha aheiwajei. Ama'n kei kachungnga iteii wai roonmak, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />kei'n Kapa kha kaminriang tihi manmasituol in injetna sik-ah Kapa in thoro iti ngaikha kei'n katho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">Intheitaru, hiwa mun makheiya eini'n situi.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu, Akadik Theibomkuung eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Akadik Theibom kuungkha kei ka-eii, halli rahuon katho kha kei Kapa eii. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Ama'n kei diangnga kaom akakaramak ayam rakip ngaikha atuktan, halli akakara ayam rakip ngaikha kheella akara nasik ama'n arathial. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Kei'n nangnidiang kileiriljei chongkhan nangni inaminthiang kha ejei. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Kei kadiang inchat lekleiya omru, halli kei'n nangnidiang inchat lekleiya omkate. Ayam bit-in akuung inchel lekleiya ikaramak angnga, nangni-um kei kadiang ningomchakmak inchu karanutun.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Kei Theibom kuungkha ka eii, halli nangni'n abaak ngaikha ning eii. Nangni'n keidiang inchat lekleiya ningom halli kei'n nangni diang inchat lekleiya kaom inchu, nangni katamma ningkarasik eii; ajarchu kei inchel lekleiya nangni iteii thomator makchu. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Kei kadiang inchat lekleiya kaommak miring khachu abaak kathamak indengjuonli akachar ka-ang kha eii; halli abaak ngaikha khoomchun inta halli meiya deengluut inta inhaalsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Nangni'n keidiang inchat lekleiya ningom khat-um kei kachong ngaikha nangnidiang inchat lekleiya om inchu, nangni'n ningnizoot kha niru, khawa kha nangni'n nimusik eii. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Nangni'n katamma kakara, khat-um kei kasiamruoi ning eii tikha minmuru. Khawakhan kei Kapa kha alur aliansik eii. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Kapa in kei inaminriang angnga, kei innum nangni kanaminriang; kei minriang nakhan inchat lekleiya omru. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Kei'n Kapa chongpeii kijui khat-um ama minriang nakhan inchat lekleiya kiom angnga, nangni'n kei chongpeii ngaikha ningjui inchu, kei minriang nakhan inchat lekleiya ningomsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Kei rokna kha nangnidiang omnasik, halli nangni rokna kha huui tungnasik-ah hiwa ngaihi kei'n nangnidiang kileiril kha ejei. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Kei'n nangni kinaminriang angnga inkhatli inkhat inriangru kitihi kei chongpeii kha eii.<verse eid="JHN 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Miring inkhat in asappui ngaisik aringkhuo ipeii itihi khawa chungtiang akalok minriang kha ommakjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:23">Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Jn 5</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Kei chongpeii ningjui inchu nangni kei kasappui ngaikha ning eii. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Kei'n nangni kha suok tia nakoi mongjei, ajarchu suok ngai'n inkaru khan angme itho tikha jetmu, khawa neek-ah, kei'n nangni kha kasappui tia kanakoi, ajarchu kei'n Kapa diang makheiya kijet rakip ngaikha nangnidiang kanarilpi suojei. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Nangni'n kei ningnakadang kha emak, takkha kei'n nangni kinakadang eii, nangni'n ningsiya katamma ningkara nasik khat-um inchat lekleiya ningkara omnasik, khat-um kei karamingnga Pa Pathian diang ning-ini rakip ngaikha nangnidiang anape nasik kei'n chuonmun kinapeii ejei. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Inkhatli inkhat inriangru, hiwahi kei chongpeii kha eii.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manmasituol Imatir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Manmasituol in nangni anamatir inchu, jetru nangni anamatir ma-ah kei inamatir kha ejei. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Nangni manmasituol mi ninglei e-inchu, manmasituol in ata iminriang angnga nangni anaminriangsik eii, takkha manmasituol makheiya inphut kei'n kinakadangjei khat-um manmasituol mi emakchujei jarra, manmasituol in nangni inamatir kha eii.<verse eid="JHN 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Kei'n nangnidiang kileiti chongkha ngaidonru, ‘Suok in amapupa neek-ah lokmak.’ Mi ngai'n kei poongna raalna innapeii inchu, nangni-um inmani'n poongna raalna innapesik eii; inmani'n kei kachong kha injui inchu, inmani'n nangni chong kha-um injuisik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Matt 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Takkha kei kami ning eii jarra inmani'n hiwa rakip ngaihi nangnidiang innathosik eii; ajarchu kei kanajuotir ama kha inmani ngai'n jetmu. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Kei'n kaleijuoli inmani ngaidiang kaleirilpi mak-inchu, inmani'n inmanu leiomnuni; takkha tuunchu inmani ileitho kha manu emak titheinunu. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Kei kanamatir miring khan kei Kapa kha-um amatir. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Kei'n inmani ngai karra tuteii itho maneiimak inlak chuon kathopimak inchu, inmani manu leiomnuni; takkha tuunchu inmani'n kei-um Kapa-um innamujei halli innamatirjei.<verse eid="JHN 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />‘Inmani'n ajar omlekleiya kei innamatir’ iti inmani Sinadan dungjuiya lei-injia kha huui tungnasik hiwahi kasuok kha eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Minpkla 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Takkha Kapa diang makheiya kei'n nangnidiang kajuotir sik, “Akanasanpa, Ratha Inthiang, Kapa diangnga inphut kasuok ama'n ajuopha khan, ama'n kei jarra sakhi esik eii. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Halli nangni-um kei jarra sakhi kha ning esik eii, ajarchu inphutna makheiya nangni'n keile ningomjei.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Nangni'n ning-insui maknasik kei'n nangnidiang hiwahi kinaleirilpi kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Synagogue makheiya nangni innapuutsik eii, halli nangni kanathat mi khan Pathian sik-ah chuon kitho eii tia a-ngaidon nasik aphakha aheiwajei. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Hiwa ngaihi inmani'n nangnidiang innathosik eii, ajarchu inmani'n Pa Pathian khat-um kei najetmu. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Inmani pha ahongtung nikhan, kei'n inmani ngai jarra kileiril eii tia ningngaidon nasik hiwa ngaihi kei'n nangnidiang kileiril kha ejei.”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Ratha Inthiang Chuon</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Kei'n nangnidiang inphutna-ah hiwa ngaihi rilmong, ajarchu kei nangnile kaleiom. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Takkha tuunchu kei kanajuotir amadiang kasisik ejei; kha e-innum nangni tuteii inkhat innum, ‘Nang hunme nasisik?’ tia keidiang narakel makchu. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Takkha kei'n hiwa ngaihi nangnidiang kati jarra, ningmalungnga akapoong khan asipjei. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Takkha kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanati: nangni thanasik eii, kei'n kisihi, kei'n kasimakngai suok-inchu, Akanasanpa kha nangnidiang juonuni; takkha kei'n kasi inchu, Kei'n ama kha nangnidiang kajuotirsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Halli ama'n ajuo phakhan, ama'n manu, nunchan kadik, khat-um chongtan jarra manmasituol diang aminjetsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Manu jarrachu inmani'n kei kadiang ngamna neimu; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />akadik jarrachu, kei Kapa diang kasisik eii, halli nangni'n kei namunutunjei; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />chongtan jarrachu hiwa manmasituol waikaroonpa kha chong intan suojei.”<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Kei'n nangnidiang tamthei kalarilsik aom, takkha nangni'n tuunchu deimaneii natunjei. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Akadik Ratha kha ajuo phakhan, ama'n nangni kha akadik rakip khan anakeiruoisik eii. Ama apumtak athomatorna ranak-ah irilkha emak, takkha ama'n ijet ngaikha arilsik eii halli akahongsuoksik ngaikha nangnidiang arillarsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ama'n kei lurna anapesik eii, ajarchu ama'n kei kata ka-ekha leita halli nangnidiang arillarsik eii. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Kapa inei rakip kha kei kata eii; khawa jarra eii ama'n kei kata leita halli nangnidiang arillarsik eii kiti kha.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poongna khat-um Hoina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Apha sootleiya nangni'n kei namunutunjei, halli apha sootlekleiya nangni'n kei namunook ningte.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ama siamruoi lekkhat in inkhatli inkhatdiang inlei-inti, “Angkeme ama'n einidiang itihi? Aphakhat-ah nangni'n kei namunutunjei, halli aphakhat suoa nangni'n kei namunook ningte, ‘Ajarchu kei'n Kapa diang kasisik eii.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />‘Aphakhat-ah’ itihi ang tiname? Ama'n angjarra itime eini'n jetmakmi!”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Inmani'n amadiang inrakelzoot tihi Jisu'n aleijet, khawa jarra ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Kei ileiti, ‘Aphakhat-ah nangni'n kei namunutunjei, halli aphakhat suoa nangni'n kei ningnamu nooksik eii.’ Hiwahi emak abe nangni'n khatli inkhat diang ning-inkel? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanati: nangni'n chapningte khat-um inwai ningte, takkha manmasituol inchu aroksik eii; nangni ningmalung kapoong kha ning-esik eii, takkha nangni poongna kha hoina hong-esik eii. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Numeisa khan nai aneisitiang apoong, ajarchu ama phakha aheitungjei; takkha nai aneisuopha khanchu, akapoong kha amaniljei, ajarchu manmasituolla naikha injuoneijei tia arok. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Khawa angnga tuun nangnidiang akapoong kha aom, takkha nangni'n kei ningnamu nooksik eii halli nangni'n ningmalungnga ningroksik eii, halli tuteii inkhat innum nangni irokkha nakasut theinunu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Khawa nikhuoni khan nangni'n kei kadiang iteii naninutun. Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kanati: kei karamingnga Kapa diang ning-ini rakip kha, ama'n anapesik eii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei karamingnga Kapa diang ning-ini rakip kha, ama'n anapesik eii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat in hin tia injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kapa diang angmokhat ningni inchu, ama'n kei karamingnga anapesik eii.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Tuun katungchu nangni'n kei karamingnga iteii nanimakchu; nangni ratharok sipnasik-ah, niru, nangni'n muningte.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manmasituol kha Matorna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Kei'n minkhina chongnga nangnidiang kaleiril; takkha kei'n nangnidiang minkhina chongnga elekleiya takkha Pa Pathian jarra nangnidiang inlarra karilnasik aphakha aheiwajei. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Khawa nikhuoni khan nangni'n kei karamingnga nani ningte; takkha kei'n nangni rathuulla Kapadiang nikate timong, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Ajarchu Kapa apumtak in nangnikha anaminriang, ajarchu nangni'n keikha ningna minriang khat-um keihi Pathian makheiya kijuo eii tia ningna-ngamna. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Kei Kapa diangnga inphut manmasituolla kijuo kha eii; inlet-ah, kei manmasituol mathaankata khat-um Kapa diang kasiritsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Asiamruoi ngai'n amadiang inleiti, “Tuunchu nang in minkhina chongnga elekleiya inthiangnga narillar jei. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Tuunchu nang in angrakip najetwiak, khat-um tuteii innum nangdiang kanarakel sik-ah arei ommakjei tihi keini'n kinjetjei; hiwa hi'n ajar eya nang Pathian diang makheiya nijuo eii tia keini'n kin-ngamnajei.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleimasang, “Tuunchu nangni'n ningngamna jeibo? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Enru, apha kha aheiwajei, tuun aheiwajei, nangni'n inchekchai ningta, halli katheinuoa nada ningta nangni rakip in ning-inn ning-inn tiang ningsisik eii; takkha kei katheinuoa emong, ajarchu Kapa keile aom. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Kei diangnga inphut akahoi akadai ningmunasik, hiwahi kei'n nangnidiang kileiti kha ejei, manmasituol hinchu poongna raalna om; takkha chimaru, ajarchu kei'n manmasituol kha kamatorjei.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Asiamruoi ngaisik Pathian diang Ani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Jisu'n hiwa chong ngaihi arilsuo thengnga, ama'n marwaan tiang enna aleiti, “Pa Pathian, aphakha aheitungjei. Sapa'n nang kha anaminlur nasik, Nasapa diang lurna lianna kha petro. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Miring rakip chungnga thomatorna ranak kha Pathian in Asapa diang apejei, halli amadiang ipejei mi rakip ngaidiang hektik kaboi ringna kha apeii. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Inkhatbit ka eii akadik Pathian kha akajet, khat-um nang ijuotirpa Jisu Christa akajet kha eii hektik kaboi ringna. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Manmasituolla nang lurna kha kei'n kamalarjei; nang in thosik chuon ninapekha kei'n kathosuojei. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Manmasituol inboolmaklai kei'n nangle kineisuom lurna lianna kha, Pa Pathian tuun namaikuungnga keidiang napetro.”<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Manmasituol makheiya nang in keidiang ninapeii miring ngaidiang Kei'n naraming kha kamalarjei. Inmani nangta in ejei, halli nang in kei kadiang nanapeii. Inmani'n nang nachong kha injuijei. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Kei kadiang ninapeii rakip ngaikha nangdiang makheiya in-eii tihi tuunchu inmani'n injetjei; <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />ajarchu kei kadiang ninapeii chong ngaikha kei'n inmani diang kapejei, halli inmani'n inkeiluut jei; inmani'n nangdiang makheiya kijuo eii tihi inthiangnga injetjei, halli keihi nang inajuotir eii tia inngamnajei.”<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Kei'n inmani sik-ah Pathian kanipi. Kei'n manmasituol sik-ah Pathian nipimong takkha nang in keidiang ninapeii ngaisik-ah Pathian kanipi, ajarchu inmani ngaihi nangta in eii. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Kei kata rakip nangta eii, khat-um nangta rakip kei kata eii, halli kei lurna lianna kha inmani diangnga inphut inlar. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Halli tuunchu kei manmasituolla ommongjei, kei'n nangdiang kahongjei, takkha inmani chu manmasituolla inlaom. Inthiang Pa Pathian! eini inkhatbit ni-eii angnga inmani-um in-enasik keidiang ninaleipeii inmani ngaihi nang naramingnga daro.<verse eid="JHN 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Kei'n inmani le kaom suomlai, kei'n nang naramingnga inmani kha kada; Pathian chong inthiang kha huui tungnasik, nang in keidiang ninapeii ngaikha kei'n kakeiruoichak, khat-um tuteii-um mangmu takkha kamangsik sapa khabit eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Minpkla 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Jn 13:18</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Takkha tuunchu kei nangdiang kahongjei; kei rokna kha inmani chungnga huui tungnasik kei'n hiwahi manmasituolla karil. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Kei'n nang nachong kha inmanidiang kapesuojei; halli manmasituol khan inmani kha amatir, ajarchu kei'n manmasituol mi ki-emak angnga inmani kha manmasituol mi emu. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Inmani ngaikha nang in manmasituol makheiya keisuonasik kei'n nimong, takkha nang in inmani ngaikha Akathamakpa makheiya sannasik-ah kani. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Kei'n manmasituol mi ki-emak angnga, inmani-um manmasituol mi emu. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Akadik khan inmani kha minthiangro; nang nachong chu akadik kha eii. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Nang in kei manmasituolla ninajuotir angnga, kei'n inmani ngaikha manmasituolla katir. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Inmani-um kadik-ah inpesuok nasik, Kei kapum takhi inmani sik-ah nang nadiang ka-inpesuok.”<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Kei'n inmani ngai sikbit Pathian diang nimong, takkha inmani chongril makheiya keidiang kangamna inmani ngaisik-um Pathian diang kani. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Pa Pathian! nang in keidiang niom, khat-um kei'n nangdiang kiom angnga, inmani'n inkhatbit in-enasik khat-um manmasituol khan keihi nang inajuotir eii tia inna-ngamnasik inmani ngai-um einidiang inomnasik tia kinani eii. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Eini inkhatbit ni-eii angnga inmani-um inkhatbit in-enasik-ah keidiang ninapeii lurna lianna kha kei'n inmanidiang kapejei. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Kei'n inmanidiang kaom halli nang in keidiang naom. Inmani-um inkhatbit etheinasik, khat-um manmasituolla keihi nang inajuotir eii, halli inmani ngai-um nang in kei ninaminriang angnga inmani kha naminriang tihi manmasituol in jetrasu.”<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Pa Pathian! nang in keidiang ninapeii ngaikha, kei omnakhan inmani-um keile kin-om suomzoot, ajarchu nang in keidiang ninapeii kei lurna lianna kha inmani innum murasu, ajarchu manmasituol injir ma-ah nang in kei kha nanaminriang. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Akadik Pa Pathian, manmasituol in nangkha najetmak, takkha kei inchu nangkha kanajetjei; halli inmani ngai'n keihi nang inajuotir eii tia innajetjei. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nang in keidiang ninaminriang kha inmani diang-um omnasik, halli kei-um inmanidiang kaom nasik, Kei'n naraming kha inmanidiang kaminjet, khat-um kei'n kalaminjetsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Insurna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matt 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Jisu'n Pathian anisuo thengnga, ama'n asiamruoi ngai khale Kidron tuiwakuok inrakaanna inleisi. Khawakhan rahuon inkhat aleiom halli Jisu khat-um asiamruoi ngai'n rahuon khan inleiluut. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Jisu kajuorsipa Judas innum amunkha aleijet; ajarchu Jisu'n asiamruoi ngai khale khawa munkhan inlei inmujol. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Judas in Rome raalmi rahooi khat-um Thiampu kalian ngaili Pharisee ngai iheitir Biak-inn kangaak mi ngai khale sariakmei, meiser khat-um chemli thal inchoiya rahuon khan inleisi. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Jisu'n ama chungnga akasuoksik rakip kha ijet khale inruoiya, ama'n aheisuok-ah inmani ngaidiang aleiti, “Tume nangni'n ning-entok?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />“Nazareth Jisu,” Inmani'n ama diang inleimasang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Jisu'n inmanidiang aleiti, “Kei ama kha ka eii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Ama kajuorpa Judas kha inmani ngaikhale khawakhan aleingir. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Jisu'n inmanidiang “Kei ama kha ka eii,” aleitipi phakhan, inmani ngaikha nuktiang inkirra khat-um neipilla inleipur. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Jisu'n inlet-ah inmanidiang aleirakel, “Tume nangni'n ning-entok?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">“Nazareth Jisu,” kha eii inmani'n inleiti.<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei'n nangnidiang amakha kei ka-eii katijei.” “Nangni'n kei ningna entok e-inchu, hiwa leiilaak mi ngaihi sitarasu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />“Nang in kei kadiang ninapeii ngaihi kei'n tuteii inkhat-um minmangmong,” ileiti chongkha huui hongtungnasik eii.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Chem kachoi Simon Peter in achem kha akeisuoli Thiampu Kaliankhetpa suok inkhat achangtiang kuorkha atuktanpi. Suokpa ramingkha Malchus inti.<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Jisu'n Peter diang aleiti, “Nachem kha akok suungnga thunro; Pa Pathian in keidiang innapejei poongna rabingkha kei'n inmak ningngabe?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Matt 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mk 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luk 22:42</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Anna Maikuungnga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Rome raalmi le inmani raallu kakeipa khat-um Jihudi kalok kalian ngai'n Jisu kha insurra inleikhuop. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Mansakhet-ah Anna diang inleiruoi; ajarchu ama kha khawa kumma Thiampu Kaliankhet ka eii Caiaphas tarpu alei-eii.<verse eid="JHN 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Caiaphas kha eii Jihudi thomatorna ranak kanei ngaidiang miring inkhat in mi rakip sik-ah akathi sik hi athawiai tia akaleiminchu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 11:49">Jn 11:49</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 11:50">50</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter in Jisu Jetmong tina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69">Matt 26:69</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mk 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simon Peter li siamruoi inkhat in Jisu kha inleijui. Hiwa siamruoipa hichu Thiampu kaliankhetpa le inlei-injet jarra ama khachu Thiampu kaliankhetpa omna inn tuollaidung katung Jisu le inruoiya aleiluut, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />takkha Peter chu kot kuungnga aleingir. Siamruoi inkhatpa khan inlet-ah tuol aheisuok rit-ah khat-um kot kangaak numeisanu diang inrilpuiya Peter kha-um aleikeiluut. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Kot kangaaknu khan Peter diang aleiti, “Nang-um hiwa miringpa siamruoi inkhat emakchebe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">“Emong, kei emong,” tia Peter in aleimasang.<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Suokngai khat-um inn kangaak raalmi ngai'n aleidaipi jarra meiholmei inleitho, halli inmani ngai'n inngirra mei inleioot. Peter um inmani ngaile a-ngirra mei aleioot.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thiampu Kaliankhetpa khan Jisu diang Chong rakel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matt 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Thiampu Kaliankhetpa khan Jisu diang ama siamruoi ngai khat-um ama iminchu jarra aleirakel. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Kei'n manmasituol diang inlarra kariljei; Jihudi ngai rakip honginchunna Synagogue-ah khat-um Biak-inna kei'n kaminchujol. Kei'n ruuk-ah iteii rilmong. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Angsik-ah nang in keidiang ninarakelme? kei iril karangai inmani ngaidiang rakelro, kei'n angme inmanidiang kileiril; kei ileiril kha inmani ngai'n injet.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Jisu'n hiwa atisuo phakhan, Ngirra kaom raalmi inkhat in Jisu kha aleikabeella aleiti, “Thiampu Kaliankhet diang hintho-ah namasangsik suok-abe?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Kei'n kadikmak kaleiril inchu, kadikmak nakha heitiro; takkha kei'n akadikkha kaleiril inchu, angjarra kei ninawuokme?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Anna in Jisu kha inkhitpumma Thiampu Kaliankhet Caiaphas diang aleithak.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter in Inlet-ah Jisu Jetmong tina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matt 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mk 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simon Peter kha a-ngirra mei oot-ah alaleiom. Inmani ngai'n amadiang inleiti, “Nang-um ama siamruoi inkhat emakchebe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Peter in zootmak-ah aleiti, “Kei emong.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Peter in akuor ituktanpipa unai kasuok Thiampu Kaliankhetpa suok inkhat in aleirakel, “Kei'n nang amale rahuon suungnga kinamu emak abe?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Peter in woikhat inlet-ah maleisei aleiril; halli khawapha takkhan arkhong kha ahongkhuong.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Pilate Maikuungnga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matt 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Halli inmani'n Jisu kha ziingtiang ma-ah Caiaphas inn makheiya waikaroonpa omna munkhan inleiruoi. Inmani Sinadan dungjuiya inlei inthiangzoot jarra khat-um Rakaanna Kahoi bubak thanasik, inmani ngaichu waikaroonpa omna munkhan leiluutmu. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Khantia Pilate in inmani diang aheisuok-ah aleirakel, “Nangni'n hiwa miringpa chungnga ang noonkuung omma ningheiruoime?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Inmani'n amadiang inleimasang, “Hiwa miringpa in akathamak aleithomak inchu, keini'n amahi nang nadiang heiruoinunung.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilate in inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni'n amahi ruoitaru halli nangni Sinadan dungjuiya ama chungnga chong tanru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Jihudi ngai'n amadiang inleiti, “Sinadan khan miring inkhattak thatsik itihi chamak.”<verse eid="JHN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Hiwahi Jisu'n ang omchanna athisikme tia ileirilsuok chongkha huui tungnasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Jn 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilate in inlet-ah aomna munkhan aluut-ah Jisu kha akoiya, “Nang Jihudi ngai Reng kha na ebe?” tia aleirakel.<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Nang napum tak-in hiwahi nitibe, emakli miring leiilaak in kei jarra nangdiang innatipibe?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilate in aleimasang, “Kei Jihudi ka eyabe? Nang nami ngai tak-in khat-um Thiampu kalian ngai'n nanghi kei kadiang innajuopeii; nang in angme nithopijei?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Kei rengramchu hiwa manmasituol ta emak; kei rengram hi hiwa manmasituol ta alei-engai suok inchu, Jihudi ngai kutchungnga kei innapemak nasik, kei kanuk kajui ngai'n raal indeisik eii; takkha kei rengramchu hiwa manmasituol hin emak.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilate in amadiang aleiti, “Enchu nang reng na-ebe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Jisu'n aleimasang, “Nang in nati khachu kei reng ka eii. Hiwa sik-ah kei innajuonei, halli hiwa akadik hi akarilsik jarra kei manmasituolla kajuo. Akadik miseng in kei kachong injui.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilate in amadiang aleirakel, “Angkeme akadik?”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilate Chongtan</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matt 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mk 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Hiwa atisuo thengnga, ama'n Jihudi ngaidiang inlet-ah aheisuok-ah aleiti, “Kei'n ama dikmakna iteii mumong. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Takkha nangni inroonna Dan ningnei khachu Rakaanna Kahoi racham kei'n miring inkhat nangni sik-ah kamasuosik eii; kei'n nangni sik-ah Jihudi ngai Rengpa hi kimasuo ningmanuombe?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Inmani ngai'n inkheek-ah inleiti “Hiwa miringpa emak, takkha Barabbas kinmanuom.” (Barabbas chu inruup alei eii.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Halli Pilate in Jisu kha aruoiya aleiminwuok. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Halli raalmi ngai'n raling lukhu inphanna ama luwa inleiminkhu, halli purple puon inchuol inleiminsil; <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />inmani'n amadiang inhongnga “Jihudi ngai Rengpa kha ringkhuo kasei erase!” intia inmani'n ama kha inleikabeel.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilate in inlet-ah aheisuok-ah inmani diang aleiti, “Enru, Kei'n amahi nangnidiang kiheiruoisuok ejei, ajarchu kei'n ama chungnga adikmakna iteii mumong tihi nangni'n ningjetnasik.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Khawa jarra Jisu'n raling lukhu inkhu-ah khat-um purple puon inchuol kha inluk-ah aheisuok. Pilate in inmani diang aleiti, “Miring pahi hin omjei!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Thiampu kalian ngai khat-um Biak-inn kangaak mi ngai'n Jisu Inleimu phakhan, inmani'n, “Cross-ah makai inlang thattaru! cross-ah makai inlang thattaru!” intia inleikheek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilate in inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni'n amahi ruoi-inlang halli cross-ah hongthattaru, ajarchu kei'n ama adikmakna mumong.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Jihudi ngai'n amadiang inleimasang, “Keini sinadan om, halli khawa sinadan dungjuiya amahi athisik suok, ajarchu apum tak-in Pathian Sapa in-eii.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilate in hiwa chonghi aleijet phakhan, ama'n kheella aleichi. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Pilate in inlet-ah aomna munkhan aluut-ah Jisu diang aleiti, “Nang humakheiya nijuome?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Takkha Jisu'n leimasangmak. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilate in amadiang aleiti, “Nang in keidiang rilnutinbe? Kei'n nang namasuo matorna khat-um cross-ah nathatnasik ranak kanei itihi nang jetmakchebe?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Chungtiang makheiya nang nadiang najuopemak inchu nang in kei kachungnga iteii ranak neinutin. Nangdiang kei najuokapeii ama kha kheella amanu alok.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Hiwahi Pilate in ajetpha khan, ama'n Jisu masuonasik lam alei-entok, takkha Jihudi ngai'n inkheek-ah inleiti, “Nang in hiwa miringpa hi namasuo inchu, nang Caesar sappui emakche; apumtak reng in-eii mi rakip kha Caesar kazootmak in-eii.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilate in hiwa chongngaihi ajet phakhan, ama'n Jisu kha aheikeisuo halli chongtanna mun Pavement inti Lung chungkhan alei in-ong, Hebrew chongnga, khawa munkha Gabbatha inti. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Rakaanna kahoi sik-ah minsuukna nikhuo; kani inding phakhan, Pilate in Jihudi ngaidiang aleiti, “Enru nangni rengpa!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Inmani'n “Thattro! ama kha thattro! Cross-ah makai inlang thattaro!” intia inleikheek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilate in inmanidiang aleirakel, “Nangni rengpa hi kei'n cross-ah thatning ngabe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Thiampu kalian ngai'n inleimasang, “Caesar elekleiya keini reng neimung.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Khawa jarra Pilate in Jisu kha cross-ah thatsik-ah inmani diang aleipeii.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Cross-ah Inthat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matt 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Khawa jarra inmani'n Jisu kha inleiruoi, halli Jisu'n ama cross araput-ah Hebrew chongnga Golgotha inti Lukiar reiina muntiang aleisi. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Khawa khan inmani'n Jisu kha aleiilaak miring innile inruoiya aweitiang khat-um achangtiang inmakaiya inleithat. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilate in “Nazareth Jisu, Jihudi ngai Reng,” tia jetna inkhat aleimajia, halli cross chungnga aleitar. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Jihudi katamtak in hiwahi inleiteel, ajarchu Jisu cross-ah inmakaili inthatna munkha khuopui koolla alei eii; halli jetna kha Hebrew, Latin khat-um Greek chongnga lei-injia. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Jihudi Thiampu kalian ngai'n Pilate diang, “ ‘Jihudi ngai Reng, tia majia maro,’ takkha ‘Hiwa mipa in kei Jihudi ngai Reng ka eii aleiti tia namajiapiro inleiti.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilate in aleimasang, “Kei'n kileimajia kha kimajia ejei.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Raalmi ngai'n Jisu kha cross-ah inthatsuo phakhan inmani'n Jisu puondiar kha raalmi ngai'n inchang thanasik lekmili inleiminsuok, halli asongkool kha-um inleilei. Takkha asongkool kha kathuilam omleiya inkhoong alei-eii.<verse eid="JHN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Khawa jarra inmani'n inkhatli khatdiang inlei inti, “Eini'n kathermui, takkha tu changsikme tikha eini'n rawaan enrui.” Hiwahi Pathian chong huui tungnasik kha eii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Kei puondiar kha inmani'n in-insem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">halli kei kasongkool sik-ah inmani'n rawaan in-en.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Hiwahi raalmi ngai'n inleitho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Minpkla 22:18</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Jisu cross koolla, anu, anu nainu, Clopas numei Mary, halli Mary Magdalene ngai'n inngirra inleiom. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Jisu'n anu khat-um iminriang asiamruoi khan akoolla inngirra inom amupha khan, Jisu'n anudiang aleiti, “Numeisa, ama hi nasapa eii.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Halli asiamruoi padiang aleiti, “Ama hi nanu eii.” Khawapha makheiya numeisanu kha siamruoi khan aruoiya inntiang sipuijei.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matt 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Hiwa thengnga Jisu'n chuon rakip hekjei ti ijetle inruoiya, Pathian chong huui tungnasik “Kei katuiraal” aleiti. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Minpkla 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Theibomju kathur kasipchei kheeng inkhat khawa khan aleiom; halli inmani'n kathur theibomju kha tuipompuon khan innoomma khuoichu ramol morra inkathilla ama murra inhongsoon. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Jisu'n akathur theibomju kha insuoli “Ahekjei!” aleiti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Khawa suoli Jisu'n ariing thep-ah athijei.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Diapnei Kaseiya insun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Insuukna nikhuo eyarra, sernikhuo (Sabbath) ni mikaluong ngaikha cross chungnga kaiya ommaknasik (Sabbath inthiang nikhuo eyarra), Jihudi ngai'n inkeii ngaikha zeemkhiakli, choinasik Pilate diang injuoni. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Khawa jarra raalmi ngai'n inheiwali Jisu le inmakaisuom miring inni ngai keiikha inleizeemkhiak. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Takkha inmani'n Jisu khachu aleithisuo inmupha khan, inmani'n akeii ngaikha leizeemkhiakmu. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Takkha raalmi ngai karra miring inkhat in kaseiya Jisu diapnei kha aleisun, halli khawapha takkhan thisen khat-um tui ajuoluong. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Nangni innum ngamna ningneinasik, akamujei ama khan sakhi eya arilsuok. Ama'n kadikkha aril, halli irilkha adik tia ama'n ajet. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />“Ama ruzaang inkhat-um zeemkhiaknunu” iti Pathian chongkha huui tungnasik hiwa ngaihi aleisuok. <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Halli Pathian chong munkhat in ati, “Kaseiya insun ama kha inmani'n in-ensik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Inreiina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Hiwa thengnga Arimathea makheiya Joseph, Jihudi ngai achijarra ruuk-ah Jisu siamruoi ka-eii ama'n Pilate diang Jisu kaluong kha napero tia aleini, halli Pilate in azootpiya aleipeii. Khawa jarra ama'n aheiwali Jisu kaluong kha aleilei.<verse eid="JHN 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Matiang Jisu inmupui sik-ah zaanchimma aleikahong Nicodemus um Joseph le inruoiya arim kahoi Myrrh li Aloes inchun pound rajakhat dam karik achoiya aleihong. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Inmani inni'n Jisu kaluong kha inleiya halli Jihudi ngai inreiina dungjuiya arim kahoi sariak le inruoiya puon kaneemma inleikatuom. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Jisu cross-ah inthatna munkhan rahuon inkhat aleiom, halli rahuon suungkhan tuteii-um inlareiinamak thaan katharkhat aleiom. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Jihudi ngai insuukna nikhuo ejarra, halli thaan kha leinaitek jarra, inmani'n Jisu kaluong kha khawa munkhan inleireii.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ahongringna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matt 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Khuoserni ziingtiang ma-ah Mary Magdalene in khuo warmaklai thaanna aleisi, halli thaankhar lungkha thaan makheiya lei-inkhai kha aleimu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Khawa jarra ama'n ataanna Simon Peter khat-um Jisu'n iminriang siamruoi inkhat padiang asiya aleiti, “Inmani'n Pumi kha thaan makheiya inleijei, halli inmani'n Pumi kha hunme inreii eini'n jetmakmijei.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Khawa jarra Peter li siamruoi inkhatpa khan thaantiang inleisi. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Inmani inni'n inleitaansuom, takkha siamruoi inkhatpa in Peter kheella thaankha aleituungmasa; <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />halli a-ngirra alei enpha khan, ama'n khawa munna linen puon kaneem intha-ah kaomkha aleimu, takkha ama'n suungnga leiluutmak. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simon Peter in anuk juiya ahongnga khat-um thaan suungnga ahongluut; halli linen puon kaneem intha-ah kaomkha ahongmu, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />halli alu inkatuomna puonkha akaneem linen puon khale leiom suommu takkha puon bitkha inthep-ah aleiom. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Halli thaan katungmasa siamruoi inkhatpa innum aleiluut-ah, ama'n amujei khat-um ngamnajei. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Khawa phakhan inmani'n ama kha akathi makheiya inphut aringsik eii iti Pathian chongkha laleijetmu. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Halli siamruoi ngaikha in-inn in-inn tiang inleikir.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mary Magdalene diang Inlar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Matt 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mk 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Takkha Mary chu thaan kot-ah a-ngirra alaleichap, ama'n achap pumma thaan suungnga alei-en; <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />halli ama'n akabang retruo katho marwaan tirton inni'n Jisu kaluong inreiina munna, luthuntiang inkhat halli kethuontiang inkhat in-ongnga kaomkha aleimu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Inmani'n inleiti, “Numeisa, angtia nichapme?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Numeisanu in inmani diang aleiti, “Inmani'n kei Pumi kha innachoideljei, halli ama kha inmani'n hun in-nareiipime tikha kei'n jetmong.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Hiwa atili, numeisanu khan ahei-inlet, halli Jisu'n ngirra kaomkha aleimu, takkha numeisanu in Jisu eii tia leijetmak. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Numeisa, angtia nang nichapme? Nang tume ni-entok?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Rahuon ka-ngaakpa lei-ete tia, numeisanu in amadiang aleiti, “Ocha, nang in ama kha naleilei inchu, ama kha hunme nireii keidiang natipiro, halli kei in ama kha leikate.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleiti, “Mary.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Mary in amadiang ahei-inlet-ah Hebrew chongnga aleiti, “Rabboni!” (hiwa tinachu Ocha tina eii).<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleiti, “Kei nakatook maro, ajarchu kei Kapa diang lakalmong; takkha kei ka-u kanai ngaidiang si inlang inmani diang juorilpiro, Kei'n Kapa khat-um ningpa, kei Pathian khat-um nangni Pathian diang kalakalsik eii.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mary Magdalene in asiya siamruoi ngaidiang ajuorilpi, “Kei'n Pumi kha kamujei” halli ama'n hiwa ngaihi amadiang aleiti tia inmanidiang aleirilpi.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n ama Siamruoi ngaidiang Inlar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matt 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Hapta mansakhet nikhuo kholeitiang khan, siamruoi ngaikha Jihudi thomatorna ranak kanei mi ngaikha inleichi jarra inn inkharra inlei-intuup, Jisu'n aheiluut-ah inmani karra a-ngirra inmani diang aleiti, “Akadai kha nangnidiang omrase.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Hiwa atisuoli atisuomak, akut khat-um adiapnei inmani diang aleiminmu. Halli Pumi inleimu phakhan asiamruoi ngaikhan inleirok. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Jisu'n inmanidiang inlet-ah aleiti, “Akadai kha nangnidiang omrase. Pa Pathian in kei inajuotir angnga, kei innum nangni kinatir kha ejei.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Halli ama'n hiwahi atisuoli tisuomak, inmani diang phuk aseemma aleiti, “Ratha Inthiang kha neitru.<verse eid="JHN 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Nangni'n mi ngai manu kha ningra-ngaidam inchu, inmani ngaidam kamu in-ejei; nangni'n inmani manu ngaikha ningra-ngaidammak inchu, inmani kha ngaidam kalamumak kha in-eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Matt 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu li Thomas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Asiamruoi soomleini ngai karra miring inkhat, inphir intia inkoi Thomas kha Jisu aheiluutlai khan inmanile leiommak. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Khantia siamruoi leiilaak ngai'n amadiang inleitipi, “Keini'n Pumi kha kinmujei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Takkha ama'n inmanidiang aleiti, “Kei'n ama kut-ah juotpi inheemnabi kamumaklaiseng halli, akut-ah juotpi inheemna khurra kakutramol kasunluut-ah kakatook maklaiseng halli kaseiya insunna adiapnei khan kakut-ah kakatook maklaiseng, kei'n ngamnanuning.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Niriat suo-ah, ama siamruoi ngaikha inlet-ah innsuungnga inleiomrit, halli Thomas um inmanile aleiom. Innkhar ngaikha inleikhar takkha Jisu'n aheiluut-ah khat-um inmani ngai karra a-ngirra aleiti, “Akadai kha nangnidiang omrase.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Halli ama'n Thomas diang aleiti, “Nang nakutramol kha hin heisoonro, halli kakut ngaihi enro; nakutkhan hongkabaan inlang kei kadiapnei hin hongdaro. Inngamnamak kha ekhaimaro takkha ngamnataro.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Thomas in amadiang aleimasang, “Kei Pumi khat-um Kei Pathian!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Kei nanamu jarra nana-ngamnajei. Mulekleiya kangamna mi ngaikha rawaan katha in-eii.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiwa Larik Amajiana ajar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Hiwa larik hin injiamak, Jisu'n inlak chuon angjet ama siamruoi ngai maikuungnga aleitho; <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Takkha nangni'n Jisu hi Messiah eii, Pathian Sapa eii, tia ningngamna sik-ah hiwa ngaisenghi inmajia kha eii, halli amadiang kangamna khan nangni ringna ningmusik eii.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Siamruoi Sari diang inlar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Hiwa thengnga Jisu apumtak in siamruoi ngaidiang Tiberias tuipuiya woikhat inlet-ah alei-inlar; halli apumtak in hintho-ah alei-inlar. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simon Peter, inphir intia inkoipa Thomas, Galilee ramsuungnga kaom Cana makheiya Nathanael, Zebedee sangai, khat-um asiamruoi leiilaak innile inleiomsuom.<verse eid="JHN 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simon Peter in inmanidiang aleiti, “Kei ngakasur sikate.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Inmani'n amadiang inleiti, “Keini um nangle kinsisuomsik eii.” Inmani'n inheisuok-ah rakuong suungnga inleiluut; takkha khawani zaan kha inmani'n iteii-um surmu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luk 5:5</ref></char><verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Khuo hongwarpha khanchu, Jisu'n tuipui khamma a-ngirra aleiom; takkha siamruoi ngai'n Jisu eii tia leijetmu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Sapngai, nga ningsurbo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">“Surmung” tia inmani'n inleimasang.<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Leen kha rakuong changtiang worru, halli nangni'n lekkhat surningte.” khawa jarra inmani'n leen kha inleiwor, halli tuunchu inmani'n leinuk maneiimu, ajarchu leenkha nga in aleisip.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Jisu'n iminriang siamruoi khan Peter diang aleiti “Pumi eii!” Simon Peter in Pumi ejei tia aleijet phakhan, apuondiar kha alei-inluk ajarchu puondiar kha alei-liik-ah leithomak, halli tuisuungnga alei-inchoomluut. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Takkha siamruoi leiilaak ngaichu nga kasipchei leenkha inkeiya rakuongnga inheiwa, ajarchu tuikham makheiya ki rajani dam bit inlei-inlaak. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Inmani'n tuikhamma inheitung phakhan, waipool lekkhat le meira-al chungnga nga inrouwa kaomkha inmani'n inleimu. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Tuntak-ah ningsur nga lekkhat heichoiru.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Khawa jarra Simon Peter in asiya leenkha tuikhamma aheinuksuok, nga kalok rajakhat le soomra-nga leithum inlei eii; akatamtak nga alei e-innum leenkha leichetmak. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Heiwa inlang ziingbu juobaktru.” Siamruoi tuteii innum “Nang tu na eme?” tia leirakelmu, ajarchu Pumi ejei tia inleijet. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Jisu'n aheiwali waipool kha aleiya inmani diang aleipeii halli khale in-angrip-ah nga kha-um aleiya inmani diang aleipeii.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Hiwahi woithum huuina Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang athiya inphut ahongringsuo thengnga inlar kha eii.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu li Peter</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Inmani'n inbaksuo phakhan, Jisu'n Simon Peter diang aleiti, “John sapa Simon, nang in hiwangai neek-ah kei nanaminriangbo?” Simon in amadiang aleiti, “Oh Pumi,” “Kanaminriang tihi nang in najet.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Kei keelngamteii ngai wairo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Jisu'n amadiang woini huuina aleiti, “John sapa Simon, kei nanaminriangbo?” Simon in amadiang aleiti, “Oh Pumi,” “Kei'n nang kanaminriang tihi nang in najet.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Kei keelngam ngai khaalro.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Jisu'n woithum huuina amadiang aleiti, “John sapa Simon, Kei nanaminriangbo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jisu'n woithum “Kei nanaminriangbo?” tia aleirakel jarra Peter in amalungnga aleipoong. Simon in amadiang aleiti, “Pumi, nang in angrakip najet; kei'n nang kanaminriang tihi nang in najet.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Kei keelngam ngai wairo. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Kei'n inthiangnga nangdiang kanati, naipang na-elai, natheinuoa nasinazoot lamma nasi; takkha upa nahong epha khan, nang in nakut nathaangsik eii halli miring inkhat in nakhoong nakhitpita nasizoot makna-ah anaruoisik eii.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Ama'n Peter angthiya thili Pathian kul ra-ang aminlursikme tijarra hiwahi iril eii. Halli hiwa thengnga Jisu'n amadiang aleiti “Kei kanuk najuiro.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu li Siamruoi Inkhatpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Peter in nuk hei-inlet phakhan, Jisu'n iminriang siamruoipa khan inmani nuk iheijuikha aleimu, zaanbu inbaklai Jisu roop-ah inngaiya, “Pumi, tume nang kanajuorsik akatipa kha eii.” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Peter in ama kha amuwa Jisu diang aleiti, “Pumi, hiwa mipa hileii?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Kei'n kajuokir maklaiseng ama'n aringsik kei'n kamanuom ngai souk-inle, khawa khan nangdiang ang eyame? Nangchu kanukkha najuiro!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Khawa khan ajar eya siamruoipa kha thinunijei iti chonghi Jisu nukkajui ngaidiang aleitung; Jisu inchu nang thinutin tia amadiang leitimak, takkha, “Kei'n kajuokir maklaiseng ama'n aringsik kamanuom ngai suok-inle, khawa khan nangdiang ang eyame?” iti eii.<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Hiwa siamruoi hi eii hiwa ngai jarra sakhi kapeii, khat-um hiwa ngai kamajia; halli eini'n ama sakhi hi adik tia nijet.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ajuohekna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Hiwa ngai ka-emak aleiilaak akatamtak Jisu'n ileitho angjet om; ileitho rakip ngaikha inmajia inchu, manmasituol pumpui innum inmajiasik larik ngaikha kengnuni tia kei'n kangaidon. Amen.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>